<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">Mipum Siarnak</book>
  <para style="h">Mipum Siarnak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mipum Siarnak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mipum Siarnak</para>
  <para style="mt">Mipum Siarnak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt ram ihsin an suah hnu kum hnihnak a thla hnihnak ih ni hmaisa bik ni ah, Sinai Nelrawn ih ummi Pathian umnak Puanthlam sungah Bawipa in Moses hnenah thu a sim. A thusimmi cu hiti in a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangmah le Aaron in Israel mi pawl cu an hrin ciar le an innsang ciarin mipum nan siar pei. Kum kul le a tlunlam mipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ralkap a ṭuan thei ding mi hmuahhmuah cu an hmin cazin lak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lo bawmtu dingah hrin khat ihsin an lal ciar sawm uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih an lal ciar cu a tanglam bangtuk in an si: Reuben hrin ihsin Shedeur fapa Elizur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simeon hrin ihsin Zurishaddai fapa Shelumiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah hrin ihsin Amminadab fapa Nahshon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Issakhar hrin ihsin Zuar fapa Nethanel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zebulun hrin ihsin Helon fapa Eliab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josef fapa pawl: Efraim hrin ihsin Ammihud fapa Elishama, Manasseh hrin ihsin Pedahzur fapa Gamaliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin hrin ihsin Gideoni fapa Abidan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan hrin ihsin Ammishaddai fapa Ahiezer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher hrin ihsin Okhran fapa Pagiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gad hrin ihsin Deuel fapa Eliasaf,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naftali hrin ihsin Enan fapa Ahira.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tlunih lal pawl cu an hrin ciarah hotu an si ih mipum siar hnaṭuantu dingah hrilmi an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi lal hleihnih pawl cu Moses le Aaron in an sawm ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thlahnihnak ni hmaisa bik ni ah Israel mi pawl cu an zatein an kokhawm a si. Israel mi zatein an hrin ciar le an innsang ciar in mipum cazin an lak ih Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kum kul le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah cu an siar ih an hmin an khum ṭheh. Sinai Nelrawn ahcun Moses in Israel mi pawl mipum cazin cu a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ralkap a ṭuan thei ding mipa kum kul le a tlunlam pawl cu an hmin rori in, Jakob fapa upa bik Reuben hrinih thok in an hrin le an innsang fekfek ciar in, cazin ah an khum. Mipum cazin an lakmi zat cu a tanglam bangtuk a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reuben hrin ihsin thawng sawmli thawng ruk le zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Simeon hrin ihsin thawng sawmnga thawng kua le zathum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gad hrin ihsin thawng sawmli thawngnga, zaruk le sawmnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah hrin ihsin thawng sawmsarih thawngli le zaruk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Issakhar hrin ihsin thawng sawmnga thawngli le zali,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun hrin ihsin thawng sawmnga thawng sarih le zali,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Efraim hrin ihsin thawng sawmli le zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Manasseh hrin ihsin thawng sawmthum thawnghnih le zahnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benjamin hrin ihsin thawng sawmthum thawngnga le zali,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dan hrin ihsin thawng sawmruk thawnghnih le zasarih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asher hrin ihsin thawng sawmli thawngkhat le zanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Naftali hrin ihsin thawng sawmnga thawngthum le zali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An zate ih kom tikah thawng zaruk thawngthum zanga le sawmnga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Levi hrin pawl cu mipum siarnak ah telhcih an si lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />ziangahtile Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl ralkap ṭuan thei ding mipum nan siar tikah Levi mi pawl cu telhcih hlah uh,” tiih a rak ti ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Levi mi pawl cu ka Puanthlam le a sungih hmanmi thilri pawl kilkhawitu-ah re hai aw. Puanthlam le a thilri pawl cu anmah in an phur pei ih ṭhatein an zoh pei; an riahbuk khal Puanthlam ih kimvel ah an sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Nan riahnak nan ṭhawn tikah Levi mi pawl in Puanthlam cu an ṭhet pei ih riahnak hmun a tharih nan khuar tikah cutawkah anmah thotho in an sak sal pei. Midang zokhal Puanthlam kiangkapih an rat asile thah an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cun a bur a bur in an riahbuk cu an sak pei ih zozo khal anmah ih hrin ciarin anmah ih thantaar thuai ciarah an sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Asinain Puanthlam kiangkapah zohman an rat lonak dingah le ka thinhengnak cu Israel mi pawl parih a thlen lonak dingah Levi mi pawl cun Puanthlam kimvel ah an riahbuk an sak pei ih an kilveng pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cun an tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in Moses le Aaron hnenah a tanglam bangtuk in thu a pek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in an riahbuk an sak tikah zozo khal anmah ih hrin ciar hnenah le anmah ih thantaar thuai ciarah an um pei. An riahbuk cu Bawipa umnak Puanthlam ih kimvelah an sak pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuahnak lamah Judah ih thantaar thuai-ah a tanglam bangtuk in anmah ih hotu ciar thawn a bur a bur in an um pei: Judah hrinah Amminadab fapa Nahshon ho in thawng sawmsarih thawngli le zaruk an si; Issakhar hrinah Zuar fapa Nethanel ho in thawng sawmnga thawngli le zali an si; Zebulun hrinah Helon fapa Eliab ho in thawng sawmnga thawng sarih le zali an si; An zate komah thawng zakhat thawng sawmriat thawng ruk le zali an ti. Judah thantaar hnuai ih ummi pawl cu hmaisabik ah an feh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlanglamah Reuben ih thantaar thuaiah a tanglam bangtuk in anmah ih hotu ciar thawn a bur a bur in an um pei: Reuben hrinah Shedeur fapa Elizur ho in thawng sawmli thawng ruk le zanga an si; Simeon hrinah Zurishaddai fapa Shelumiel ho in thawng sawmnga thawngkua le zathum an si; Gad hrinah Deuel fapa Eliasaf ho in thawng sawmli thawngnga zaruk le sawmnga an si. An zate komah thawng zakhat thawng sawmnga thawngkhat zali le sawmnga an si. Reuben ih thantaar thuaiih ummi pawl cu a pahnihnak ah an feh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule a hmaisa bur hnih le a dungih bur hnih karlakah Puanthlam a phurtu Levi mi pawl an feh pei. Cuih a bur a bur in a fehtu Israel mi pawl cu anmah ih thantaar thuai ciarah an riahnak ih an umdan vek thothoin an feh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nitlaknak lamah Efraim ih thantaar thuaiah a tanglam bangtuk in anmah ih hotu ciar thawn a bur a bur in an um pei: Efraim hrinah Ammihud fapa Elishama ho in thawng sawmli le zanga an si; Manasseh hrinah Pedahzur fapa Gamaliel ho in thawng sawmthum thawnghnih le zahnih an si; Benjamin hrinah Gideoni fapa Abidan ho in thawng sawmthum thawngnga le zali an si; An zate komah thawng zakhat thawngriat le zakhat an si; Efraim thantaar thuaiih a ummi pawl cu a pathumnak ah an feh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saklam ah Dan ih thantaar thuaiah a tanglam bangtuk in anmah ih hotu ciar thawn a bur a bur in an um pei: Dan hrinah Ammishaddai fapa Ahiezer ho in thawng sawmruk thawnghnih le zasarih an si; Asher hrinah Okhran fapa Pagiel ho in thawng sawmli thawngkhat le zanga an si; Naftali hrinah Enan fapa Ahira ho in thawng sawmnga thawngthum le zali an si; An zate komah thawng zakhat thawng sawmnga thawng sarih le zaruk an si. Dan ih thantaar thuai ummi pawl cu neta bikah an feh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A bur a burih an homi Israel mi pawl cu an zate komah thawng zaruk thawngthum zanga le sawmnga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in Israel mi pawl lakah Levi hrin pawl cu siarcih an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pekmi bangtuk cun Israel mi pawl in an tuah thluh. An riah tikah anmah ih thantaar thuai ciarah an riak ih an feh tik khalah anmah ih hrin ciarin an feh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Sinai tlang ah Moses hnenih thu a sim tikah Aaron le Moses ih tefa pawl cu a tanglam bangtuk in an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron in fapa pali a nei; upa bik cu Nadab a si ih a dang pawl cu Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anmah cu puithiam ṭuan dingah hriakculhnak le kutsuannak ngahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Nadab le Abihu cu Sinai nelrawn ah Bawipa hnenih a thianghlim lomi mei-ur thawinak an pek ruangah an pahnih in thah an tong. Fa pakhat hman an nei lo; curuangah an pa Aaron a nun sung hmuahhmuah cu Eleazar le Ithamar in puithiam hna an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi mi pawl cu puithiam Aaron hnenih um dingah le a hna ṭuan dingah ratpi hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka umnak Puanthlam hrangih a ṭulmi, Israel misenpi le anmah puithiam pawl hrangih a ṭulmi hnaṭuan pawl an ṭuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih ummi thilri pawl an kilkhawi pei ih Israel mi pawl hrangah biaknak hnaṭuantu an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mi sung in Levi mi pawl cu Aaron le a fapa pawl riantu dingah pek an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain puithiam hnaṭuan ṭuantu dingah cun Aaron le a fapa pawl lawng an si pei. Zozo khal Aaron le a fapa pawl ih hnaṭuan a ṭuan tumtu cu thah an si pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Atu-ihsin Israel mi pawl ih fapatir hmuahhmuah ai-ah Levi mi pawl cu ka lak pei ih keimah ih ta an si thlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ziangahtile Izipt ram ah Izipt mi pawl ih fapa upa bik ka thah thluh tikah Israel mi pawl ih fapa upa bik hmuahhmuah le ṭilva pawl ih fatir hmuahhmuah cu ka thianhlimter ih keimah ih hrangah ka hammi an si. Atu-ah Israel mi pawl fapatir aiah Levi mi pawl ka lak a si. Keimah cu Bawipa ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sinai nelrawn ah Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Levi mi pawl cu an hrin ciar le an innsang ciarin thla khat le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah mipum na siar pei,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk in Moses cun a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi in fapa pathum a nei: Gershon, Kohath le Merari an si ih anmah cu an hrin ciarih cithlahtu an si ruangah an hmin cu an hrin hminah an cangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gershon in fapa pahnih a nei ih Libni le Shimei an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kohath in fapa pali a nei ih Amram, Izhar, Hebron le Uzziel an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Merari in fapa pahnih a nei ih Mahli le Mushi an si. Anmah cu cithlahtu an si ih an hmin cu an hrin hmin ciarah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gershon cithlah ah hrin pahnih an um ih Libni hrin le Shimei hrin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipa thla khat ti le a tlunlam hmuahhmuah mipum an siar tikah an zatein thawng sarih le zanga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl cu nitlaknak lam, Puanthlam ih dunglamah an riahbuk sak ding an si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lael fapa Eliasaf cu an lal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Puanthlam an kilkhawi ding ih a lenglam khuh siseh a sunglam khuh siseh, Puanthlam luhnak sangka puanzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puanthlam le biakṭheng kimvelih a ummi kulhnak puanzar pawl le kulhnak sangka puanzar tla a kiltu an si. Hi thilri pawl hrangih a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah ṭuantu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kohath cithlah ah hrin pali an um. Amram hrin, Izhar hrin, Hebron hrin le Uzziel hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thla khat le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah mipum an siar ih an zatein thawngriat le zaruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl cu Puanthlam ih thlanglam kapah an riahbuk an sak ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzziel ih fapa Elizafan cu an lal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anmah cu Thukam Kuang, cabuai, meisa vannak tung, biakṭheng pawl, Hmun Thianghlim ih puithiam pawl ih an hmanmi beelkheng pawl le Hmun Thianghlim Bik sangka puanzar pawl an kilkhawi ih hi thilri pawl thawn peh-aw in ṭuan a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah a ṭuantu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Levi mi pawl ih lal cu puithiam Aaron ih fapa Eleazar a si. Amah cu Hmun Thianghlim ih hnaṭuantu pawl hotu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Merari cithlah ah hrin pahnih an um. Mahli hrin le Mushi hrin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thla khat le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah mipum an siar ih an zatein thawng ruk le zahnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An hrin ih lal cu Abihail ih fapa Zuriel a si. Hi hrin pawl cu Puanthlam ih saklam ah an riahbuk an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Anmah tla cu Puanthlam saknak thing pawl, phartlang pawl, a ṭhuam pawl, a tawdam pawl le innkilih a pehtuah pawl an kilveng ih hi thilri pawl hrangih a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah an ṭuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih tlunah a lenglam kulhnak hrangih ṭhuam pawl, a tawdam pawl, hri khihnak fungkhen pawl le hridai pawl tla an kilveng ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moses le Aaron le a fapa pawl cu Puanthlam ih nisuahnak lamah an riahbuk an sak pei. Israel mi pawl hrangah Hmun Thianghlim ih tuah dingmi hnaṭuan hmuahhmuah cu anmah in an ṭuan ding. Cuih hnaṭuan cu midang pakhatkhat in ṭuan a tum asile thah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Levi mi pawl, thla khat le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih thupeknak vekin Moses in an hrin ciarin mipum a siar tikah an zatein thawngkul hluanhnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Israel mi pawl ih fapa upa bik thla khat le a tlunlam hmuahhmuah cu an hmin rori in cazin lak thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keimah hi Bawipa ka si. Israel mi fapa upa bik hmuahhmuah aiah Levi mi pawl cu ka ta dingah ka ham a si; cule Israel mi ṭilva-ih fatir hmuahhmuah aiah Levi mi pawl ih ṭilva pawl ka ham a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moses in Bawipa ih thupekmi cu a thlun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />thla khat le a tlunlam fapa upa bik hmuahhmuah mipum a siar tikah an zatein thawngkul hluanhnih zahnih sawm sarih le pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Moses hnenah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl fapa upa bik aiah Levi mi pawl cu ka ta dingah hlan awla, Israel mi pawl ṭilva-ih fatir hmuahhmuah aiah Levi mi pawl ih ṭilva cu i pe aw. Levi mi pawl cu ka ta an si ding. Keimah cu Bawipa ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl ih fapa upa bik pawl cu Levi mi hnakin zahnih sawm sarih le pathum in an tam sawn a si ruangah a hleimi fapa pawl cu na tlen pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hotu upa pawl ih an hman ṭheu vekin fapa pakhat cu ngun tangka fang nga in na tlen pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cuih tangka cu Aaron le a fapa pawl hnenah na pek pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A ti vek in Moses in a thlun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />ngun tangka thawngkhat zathum sawmruk le fangnga a suah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Levi mi Kohath hrin pawl hi an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum siar awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thukham retnak Puanthlam sungih hna ṭuan thei ding pawl, kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah in cazin sungah khum hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hnaṭuan dingmi cu a thianghlim bikmi a si,” tiah a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in a tanglamih daan pawl cu Moses hnenah a pek: Nan riahnak ṭhawn ding a si tikah Aaron le a fapa pawl cu Puanthlam sungah an lut pei ih Thukham Kuang hmaiih a ummi puanzar cu an lak pei ih cumi cun Thukham Kuang cu an khuh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih parah saphaw a ṭha bikmi in an khuh pei ih puan mepian in an khuh beet pei; cule a zawnnak fung pawl cu an hrolh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih pekmi sang hunnak cabuai cu puan mepian in an khuh pei ih a par ahcun pakan pawl, rimhmui kheng pawl, thawinak kheng pawl le sabit palang pawl an ret pei. Cabuai parah cun cat loin sang an hung pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih pawl parah puan sen an khuh pei ih saphaw ṭha bik in an khuh beet pei; cuih hnuah a zawnnak fung pawl an hrolh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meivannak ṭhuam cu meivannak pawl, caiceh pawl, mei urnak thir kheng pawl le olif siti retnak dawng pawl thawn puan mepian in an khuh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih a thilri pawl thawn meivannak ṭhuam cu saphaw ṭha bik in an tuam pei ih a zawnnak fung parah an ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun sui biakṭheng cu puan mepian in an khuh pei ih saphaw ṭha bik in an khuh beet pei; cuih hnuah a zawnnak fung an hrolh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim ih hmanmi khokheng pawl hmuahhmuah cu puan mepian in an tuam pei ih saphaw ṭha bik in an khuh pei ih a zawnnak fung parah an ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sathau thawn a rawi-awmi vutcam cu biakṭheng ihsin an lawk pei ih puan sendup in an khuh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule a parah cun biakṭheng ih hmanmi thilri hmuahhmuah: mei urnak kheng pawl, sa thurnak darhai ṭiak pawl, vutcam lawhnak cawhleek pawl le maihum pawl an ret pei. Cun saphaw ṭha bik in an khuh pei ih a zawnnak fung pawl an hrolh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Riahnak an ṭhawn tikah Aaron le a fapa pawl in thilri thianghlim thamzarh hmuahhmuah cu an khuh thluh hnu lawnglawngah Kohath hrin pawl cu a phurtu dingin an ra pei. Sikhalsehla an phurh tikah an tham hrimhrim lo pei; an tham pang asile an thi ding. Puanthlam ṭhawn tikih hnaṭuan ṭulmi pawl cu Kohath hrin pawl ih ṭuanvo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puithiam Aaron ih fapa Eleazar in Puanthlam pumpuluk le meisa hrangih siti, rimhmui, thlairawl thawinak, culh dingah hriak, le Puanthlam sungih a ummi Bawipa ih thil hmuahhmuah a zoh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kohath hrin pawl cu thil thianghlim kiangkapah ra hlah hai seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thihnak an tong pang ding. Thihnak an ton lonak dingah Aaron le a fapa pawl an lut ding ih an hnaṭuan ding cu an thiah aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain puithiam pawl in thil thianghlim pawl ṭhawn ding an ngaihtuah laiah Kohath hrin pawl Puanthlam sungah lut in an zoh a si ahcun an thi rori ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Levi phun, Gershon hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum siar awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu cazin lak ṭheh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule an phurh dingmi thilri pawl cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Puanthlam, a sung khuh le a leng khuh thawn, a par khuh saphaw ṭha bik le a sung luhnak sangka puanzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puanthlam le biakṭheng kulhnakih hmanmi puanzar le hridai pawl, kulhnak sangka puanzar pawl le hi thilri pawl hrangih a ṭulmi thil terek pawl hmuahhmuah an si ding. Hi thilri pawl hrangih a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah cu an tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl in phurh ding le ṭuanvo an pekmi hmuahhmuah an ṭuan suaknak dingah Moses le Aaron nanmah rori in feltein nan zoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tlunlam bangtuk in Puanthlam sungih ṭuanvo cu Gershon hrin pawl in an lak pei ih puithiam Aaron fapa Ithamar ho in an ṭuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Levi phun Merari hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum siar awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu an hmin cazin lak thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anmah cu Puanthlam ih tungtlang pawl, phartlang pawl, ṭhuam pawl, ṭhuam tawdam pawl le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Puanthlam kulhnak ṭhuam pawl, ṭhuam tawdam pawl, hrisihnak fungkhen pawl, hridai pawl le hi thilri pawl hrangih a ṭulmi thil terek hmuahhmuah a phurtu an si pei. An hmin sal fekfek in an phurh dingmi ciar cu pek an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih Merari hrin pawl ṭuanvo cu a tlunlam bangtuk hi a si. Puithiam Aaron fapa Ithamar ih ho in an ṭuan pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi thlun in Moses, Aaron le Israel miphun hruaitu pawl cun Levi hnam Kohath hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum an siar ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu hmin cazin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmin an lakmi minung zat cu thawnghnih zasarih le sawmnga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thupeknak bangtuk in Kohath hrin pawl cu Moses le Aaron in mipum an siar ih Puanthlam sung hnaṭuan theitu minung hizat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gershon hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum an siar ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu hmin cazin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hmin an lakmi minung zat cu thawnghnih zaruk le sawmthum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thupeknak bangtuk in Gershon hrin pawl cu Moses le Aaron in mipum an siar ih Puanthlam sung hnaṭuan theitu minung hizat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Merari hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum an siar ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu hmin cazin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hmin an lakmi minung zat cu thawngthum le zahnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thupeknak bangtuk in Merari hrin pawl cu Moses le Aaron in mipum an siar ih Puanthlam sung hnaṭuan theitu minung hizat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Levi hrin pawl cu an sungkhat le an innsang ciarin mipum an siar ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan theitu ding kum sawmthum le kum sawmnga karlak mipa hmuahhmuah cu hmin cazin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hmin an lakmi minung zate cu thawngriat zanga le sawmriat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in an ṭuan ding le an phurh dingmi ṭuanvo cu pakhat fingfing an pek. Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin pakhat pakhat in cazin ah an khum a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in anmah lakih phaarnat a tuarmi le a thihnai a dokmi le miruak a dai ruangih a thiangfai lomi hmuahhmuah cu an riahnak hmun ihsin an dawi thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnenih ka umnak an riahnak hmun cu an balhter lonak dingah a thiangfai lomi hmuahhmuah cu nunau siseh, mipa siseh, dawi thluh hai seh,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cun an thlun ih mi thiangfai lo pawl cu an riahnak ihsin an dawi thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a tanglamih daan pawl cu Israel mi pawl hrangah a pek. Mipa siseh, nunau siseh, midang parah sualnak tuah tahrat in Bawipa hmaiah rintlak lo a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a sualnak cu a phuang pei ih a tisual man cu cupa hnenah kimte in a kuan hlei ah zateek kul a beet pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a tuahmawhmi cu a thi ih a kuanmi saangtu dingah sungkhat suahpi zohman a neih lo a si ahcun puithiam ih hman dingah Bawipa ih hnenah a pek pei. Hi pekmi cu sualthlah thawinak hrangih tuucang a pekmi hlei ah beetmi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Israel mi pawl in Bawipa ih hnenah a hleice ih thawinak an pekmi pohpoh cu a rak saangtu puithiam ih ta a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam poh in a hnenih an pekmi laksawng cu a co pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a tanglam daan pawl cu Israel mi hrangah a pek. Pasal neimi nunau in mipa dang thawn a sual ih miborhhlawh ah a cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />asinain a sual cu phuang loin a thup ringring; a sual lai an kai lo ih a hmutu le an um fawn lo naón a pasal cun zum lonak a nei ih a nupi parah a lung a hring ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Culole a nupi cun sualnak zianghman a tuah lo naón a pasal in a zum lo. A nupi a thiik ruangih zum lo meen a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ziangziang a si khalle hi bangtuk ih thu a um ahcun a pasal in a nupi cu puithiam hnenah a fehpi pei. Thlairawl thawinak hrangih a ṭulmi barli sangvut cuai hrek a keng pei ih thawinak a pek pei. Asinain olif siti le frankincense rimhmui cu a toih lo pei. Ziangahtile himi cu lunghringtu a pasal in thudik theih duh ruangih a pekmi thawinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puithiam in cuih nunau nu cu biakṭheng hmaiah a suahpi pei ih Bawipa ih hmai ahcun a dingter pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun puithiam in tlak beel pakhat a lak pei ih a sungah tidai thiangfai tawkfang a ret pei; cule Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sungih leivut a lak pei ih, tidai cu khaa dingin, tidai ah a phulh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih hnuah puithiam in nunau nuih samtom a phoih pei ih nunau nuih kut sungah thawinak sangvut a ret pei. Amah puithiam in siatserhnak thlentertu tidai cu a beel in a keng pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule puithiam in nunau nu cu, “Mipa dang thawn na sual lo a si ahcun siatserhnak a thlentu hi tidai in lo siatsuah hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain pasal nei cingin mipa dang thawn nan sual ngaingai a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in na hmin cu na miphun lakih midang camsiatnak ah hmang seh. Bawipa in na pumpi thlingter sehla na zahmawh caarter seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi tidai cu na pum sungah lut in na pumpi cu thlingter ciamco sehla na zahmawh khal caarter thluh seh,” tiah siatserhnak a tuahter pei. Cutikah nunau nu cun, “Si hram seh, Amen,” tiah a sawn pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun cuih siatserhnak cu puithiam in a ngan pei ih a nganmi cu beel sungih thlalet cammi siatti sung ahcun a tleuh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tidai cu nunau nuih pum sungih natnak besia suakter dingin a inter hlan ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />puithiam in nunau nu kut sungih a ummi thlairawl thawinak sangvut cu a lak pei ih Bawipa ih hnenah a hun thlir hnuah biakṭheng parah a ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun thawinakih pekmi a si ti langternak ah sangvut cu zatekhat a lak pei ih biakṭheng parah a ur pei. Cule neta bikah tidai cu nunau nu a inter pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mipa dang thawn an sual ngaingai asile tidai cun a pum a natter ding ih a pumpi a ṭhang vivo ding ih a zahmawh khal a caar vivo ding. A hmin cu a miphun lakah siatserhmi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a sual lo a si ahcun siatsuahnak a tong lo pei ih fa khal a nei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi daan cu mipa pakhat in a thuneihnak thuaiih a ummi a nupi a thiik ih mipa dang thawn an sual ruangah zum lonak a neih tikah thlun ding mi daan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Culole a nupi a thiik meen ruangih zum lonak a neih ruangah a si khalle thlun dingmi daan a si. Cutiin biakṭheng hmaiah nunau nu cu a dinter pei ih puithiam in hi thawinak cu a tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pasal cu mawh a phur lo pei; asinain a nupi cu a sual a si ahcun sualman a tuar pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a tanglam daan pawl cu Israel mi pawl hrangah a pek. Mipa siseh, nunau siseh, a hlei ih pumpe-awmi Nazir si dingah thukamnak a tuah ih Bawipa hnenah pe-aw in a hrante ih a um sungah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabit le zu a dai lo pei. Sabit rah ih tuahmi sabitti siseh, sabit zu siseh, ziang hman a in lo pei; sabit rah cu a hring in siseh, a car in siseh, a ei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nazir a si sung hmuahhmuah ah sabit kung ihsin ngahmi pohpoh, a mu le a rah le a hawng tiangin, a ei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nazir thukamnak thuaiih a um sung hmuahhmuah a sam a met lo pei ih a hmurhmul siseh, a khahmul siseh, a met lo pei. Bawipa hnenih a pumpek thukamnak in a kaihrem sung hmuahhmuah a sam le a khahmul a zuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miruak kiangah a feh lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nu a pa, a u a nau ih ruak a si hmanah a naih lo pei. Miruak kiangah feh tahrat in a borhhlawh-awter lo pei; Bawipa hnenih a pumpeknak hminsinnak cu a sam le a hmul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nazir a si sung hmuahhmuah Bawipa ih hnenah a thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi pakhat rin lopi in Nazir kiangte-ah a thi ih Nazir ih sam a borhhlawhter a si ahcun ni sarih sung a hngak hnuah a sam le a khahmul pawl cu a met pei; cuticun a borhhlawhnak in a thiang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni riat ni ah thuro pahnih, a si lole laileng pahnih, puithiam hnenah Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sangka ah a rak keng pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiam in thuro pakhat cu sualthlah thawinakah a pek pei ih a dang pakhat cu mei-ur thawinakah a pek pei. Cuticun miruak a dai pang ruangih sualthlahnak cu puithiam in a tuah pei. Cuih ni ah a lu cu a thianghlimter sal ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nazir si dingah a pum cu Bawipa ih hnenah a pek sal pei. A rak thianhlimter ciami a sam cu a borhhlawhter ruangah a cuih hlanih a tikcu hmuahhmuah cu a lak a si thluh. Cule mawhnak thawinakah kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat a keng pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nazir sinak thukammi tikcu a cem tikah a tanglam thawinak a tuah pei. Puanthlam sangka ah a feh pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />raitluan ṭilva pathum Bawipa ih hnenah a pek pei: mei-ur thawinak hrangah kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat, sualthlah thawinak hrangah kum khat ti tuula pakhat le, remnak thawinak hrangah tuucang pakhat a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih tlunah thilnu tel lo sang bawm khat: olif siti thawn rawi tahratih tuahmi sang sah zet pawl, a paa zetih olif siti hnihmi sang pawl le a ṭulmi thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cupawl cu puithiam in Bawipa ih hnenah a keng pei ih sualthlah thawinak le mei-ur thawinak pawl cu a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih remnak thawinak hrangah tuucang pakhat le sang bawm khat khal a pek pei ih thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak khal a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nazir cun Puanthlam sangka ah a sam cu a met pei ih remnak thawinak an urnak meisa-ah a sam cu a va paih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun puithiam in an suanmi tuucang ih a liangsa a lak pei ih thilnu tel lo a sahzetmi sang le bawm sungih sang paazet thawn Nazir ih kut sung ahcun a ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih hnuah puithiam in Bawipa ih hnenah a pek pei; hi pekmi pawl cu puithiam hrangah laksawng thianghlim an si ih, tuucang ih cawn le ir thawn puithiam ih co ding hrimhrim an si. Cuih hnuah Nazir cun sabitti a in thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tlunih daan pawl cu Nazir pawl hrangah an si; asinain Nazir pakhatkhat in a ṭulmi hnakih tam sawn pek dingin thu a kam a si ahcun a thukammi vekin a thlun fekfek thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah thu a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aaron le a fapa pawl in Israel mi pawl thlawsuahnak an pek tikah a thuailam bangtuk in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘ Bawipa in lo thlawsuah in lo kilveng hram seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa cu nan parah zaangfahnak le lainatnak nei hram seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in a mithmai ṭha lo pe in daihnak lo pe hram seh,’ an ti pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah Israel mi hrangih thla an cam tikah hi thlawsuah peknak hi an hman a si ahcun Bawipa in a thlawsuah hai ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Bawipa umnak Puanthlam a din ṭheh ni ah Puanthlam le a thuamhnaw pawl, biakṭheng le a thuamhnaw pawl cu hriak a culh ih Bawipa ih hnenah apnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Israel phun sungah an hrin ciarih hotu pawl, mipum siar ih ṭuanvo pekmi pawl cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah apnak an tuah. An pekmi pawl cu a khuh neimi cawleng paruk le cawcang hlei hnih, hotu pahnih in cawleng pakhat le hotu pakhat in cawcang pakhat ciar an pek a si. An laksawng an pek ṭheh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Puanthlam hrangih hnaṭuannak ah hi laksawng pawl hi sang aw; cule hnaṭuan an neih ciarmi vekin Levi mi pawl hnenah pe aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih a ti bangtuk in Moses cun cawleng le cawcang pawl cu Levi mi hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cawleng pahnih le cawcang pali cu Gershon hrin pawl hnenah a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cawleng pali le cawcang pariat cu Merari hrin pawl hnenah a pek. An hnaṭuanmi hmuahhmuah cu Aaron fapa Ithamar ih ho in an ṭuan ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Moses in Kohath hrin pawl hnenah cawleng siseh, cawcang siseh, a pe lo; ziangahtile annih cu thilri thianghlim pawl ṭuanvo latu an si ih an liang in zawntu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun biakṭheng cu hriak an culh ih Pathian hnenih apnak an tuah ni ah hotu pawl cun laksawng an pek. An laksawng cu biakṭheng ih an rak ken tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Sim hai awla, biakṭheng apnak hrangih an laksawng cu ni khatah hotu pakhat, nitin in ni hleihnih sung an pek pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah an laksawng cu a tanglam bangtuk in a sangsang in an pek: Ni khatnak ah Judah hrin Amminadab ih fapa Nahshon in a pek. Ni hnihnak ah Issakhar hrin Zuar ih fapa Nethanel in a pek. Ni thumnak ah Zebulun hrin Helon ih fapa Eliab in a pek. Ni linak ah Reuben hrin Shedeur ih fapa Elizur in a pek. Ni nganak ah Simeon hrin Zurishaddai ih fapa Shelumiel in a pek. Ni ruknak ah Gad hrin Deuel ih fapa Eliasaf in a pek. Ni sarihnak ah Efraim hrin Ammihud ih fapa Elishama in a pek. Ni riatnak ah Manasseh hrin Pedahzur ih fapa Gamaliel in a pek. Ni kuanakah Benjamin hrin Gideoni ih fapa Abidan in a pek. Ni hranak ah Dan hrin Ammishaddai ih fapa Ahiezer in a pek. Ni hleikhatnak ah Asher hrin Okhran ih fapa Pagiel in a pek. Ni hleihnihnak ah Naftali hrin Enan ih fapa Ahira in a pek. Hi hotu pakhat fingfingih an pekmi laksawng cu a bangrep ciar a si: upa-ih khiahmi cuaithlainak in cuai khat le ṭikal sawmthum a ritmi ngun kheng pakhat, ṭikal sawm sarih a ritmi ngun maihum pakhat, an pahnih in thlairawl thawinak hrang a ṭulmi siti thawn rawimi sangphut an khat veve; cun ṭikal pahra a rit ih rimhmui khatte-in a ummi sui pakan pakhat; mei-ur thawinak hrangah cawcangte pakhat, tuucang pakhat le kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat; sualthlah thawinak hrangah me pakhat; remnak thawinak hrangah cawcang pahnih, tuucangte panga, mecang panga, le kum khat ti tuucang panga ciar an pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Hotu hleihnih in biakṭheng apnak hrangih laksawng an pekmi zate cu a tanglam bangtuk in a si: Ngun kheng hleihnih le ngun maihum hleihnih, an zate in cuai kul hluanli a rit. Sui pakan hleihnih an si ih cuai khat le ṭikal kul a rit; an zatein rimhmui an khat ṭheh. Mei-ur thawinak hrangah cawcang hleihnih, tuucang hleihnih, kum khat ti tuucangte hleihnih le cumi thawn pek tlang ding thlairawl thawinak. Sualthlah thawinak hrangah me hleihnih. Remnak thawinak hrangah cawcang kul hluanli, tuucang sawmruk, me sawmruk le kum khat ti tuucangte sawmruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Moses cu Bawipa thawn bia-aw dingih Puanthlam sungih a luh tinte in Thukam Kuang parih a ummi cherubim pahnih karlak ihsin Bawipa ih aw cu a thei ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aaron kha sim awla meivannak ṭhuam ah meisa pasarih a van tikah hmailam tleu dingin vang seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ti bangtuk in Aaron cun meivannak ṭhuam ih meisa cu hmailam tleu dingin a vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih meivannak ṭhuam cu, Bawipa in Moses hnenih a riruang hmuh zo vekin a zik in a tawhram tiang sosutmi sui ih tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi mi pawl cu Israel misenpi lakin a dangte in ret awla hiti in thianfaiter hai aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thianfainak dingah tidai theh awla an taksa pumpi in an hmul an met hnuah an hnipuan sawp hai seh. Cuticun an thiangfai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi mi pawl in cawcangte pakhat le thlairawl thawinak hrangih a ṭulmi olif siti thawn rawimi sangphut an keng pei; cule nang in sualthlah thawinak hrangah a dang cawcang pakhat na keng pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Israel misenpi cu pumkhawmter awla Levi mi pawl cu ka umnak Puanthlam hmaiah ra hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Israel misenpi pawl in Levi mi pawl ih lu parah an kut an suang pei ih ka hna an ṭuannak dingah Aaron in ka hnenah a ap pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmah cu Israel mi lakin a dangte in a hleice ih apmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Levi mi pawl in cawcang pahnih ih lu parah an kut an suang pei. Levi mi pawl thianfaiternak dingah cawcang pakhat sualthlah thawinakah pek a si pei ih, a dang pakhat cu mei-ur thawinakah pek a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Levi mi pawl cu a dangte in le a hleice in ka hnenah i pe awla, anmah hotu-ah Aaron le a fapa pawl ret hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuticun Levi mi pawl cu Israel misenpi hnen ihsin a dangte-ah ret awla keimah ih minung an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi mi pawl cutiih na thianfaiter hnu le na ap hnu ahcun Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuantu dingah an tlak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel miphun ih fapatir hmuahhmuah aiah ka ham zomi an si ih keimah ih bulta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izipt ramih Izipt mi fatir hmuahhmuah ka thihter tikah Israel mi fapatir hmuahhmuah le an ṭilva ih fatir hmuahhmuah cu keimah ih ta dingah ka thianhlimtermi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mi fapatir hmuahhmuah aiah Levi mi pawl cu ka lakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puanthlam ih hnaṭuan dingah le Hmun Thianghlim ah Israel mi pawl an rat ih thihnak an ton pang lonak ding kilkhawitu-ah anmah cu Aaron le a fapa pawl hnenah ka pek. Cuih tlunah annih cu Israel mi pawl lak ihsin a hleice in ka hnenih apmi si dingah ka hrilmi an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in Moses le Aaron le Israel mi hmuahhmuah in Levi mi pawl cu Pathian hnenah an ap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Levi mi pawl cu an thianfai aw-ih an hnipuan an sawp ih Aaron in Bawipa ih hnenah laksawng hleice-ah anmah cu a pek. An hrangah sualthlah thiannak khal a tuah sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuticun Levi mi pawl cu Aaron le a fapa pawl ih ho in Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuantu ah a tlakmi ah an cang. Bawipa in Moses hnenah Levi mi pawl parih tuah ding thu a pek vekin misenpi pawl cun an tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Levi mi pawl cu ka umnak Puanthlam ah kum kul hluannga an ti in hnaṭuan an thok pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />kum sawmnga an ti-ah an cawl pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnu cun Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan an duh lai hrih asile an rualpi pawl bawmtu lawng an si thei pei. Anmahte cun hna an ṭuan nawn lo pei. Cubangtuk in Levi mi pawl ih hnaṭuannak cu na tawlrel sak pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi an suah hnu a kum hnihnak thla hmaisabik ah Sinai nelrawn ah hiti in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in Lantak Puai cu a tikcu a kim tinte in tuah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thla ni hleili nitlak vete in tuah ding timi le thlun ding timi daan hmuahhmuah vekin an tuah pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in Lantak Puai tuah ding cu a sim ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a sim vek cun thla hmaisa bikih ni hleilinak siim lamin Sinai nelrawn ahcun an tuah. Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cun an tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain mi hrekkhat cu miruak an tham ruangah mi thiangfai lo an si ih cuih ni-ih Lantak Puai ah an tel thei lo. Curuangah Moses le Aaron hnenah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Miruak kan tham ruangah kannih cu mi thiangfai lo kan si. Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl in Bawipa hnenih thawinak an pek tikah tel thei lo dingin ziangah so in kham?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in, “Nan hrangih Bawipa ih thupekmi ka ngah hlan lo cu rak hngak hrih uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Israel mi pawl than dingah Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Anmah siseh, an tesinfa pawl siseh, miruak dai ruangih mi thiangfai lo an si tikah siseh, khual lamhla an tlawn tikah siseh, Lantak Puai an hmang duh thotho a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thla hnihnak ni hleili zanlam khuathim zawng in an hmang thei ve pei. Cumi puai cu thilnu rawi lo sang le ankha hnah thawn an tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thahmi tuu ih ruh cu pakhat hman an khiak lo pei ih, rawl cu a thaizing tiang hlah-mi an nei lo pei. Lantak Puai cu thlun ding timi daan vekin an ul pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi pakhatkhat thianfai lonak ziang hman a nei lo ih khual khal a tlawng lo naón Lantak Puai a tuah lo a si ahcun amah cu ka miphun sungah siarcih a si nawn lo pei. Ziangahtile a tikcu ah ka hnenih thawinak a pek lo ruangah a si. A sualman cu amah in a tuar pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“An lakih a um ramdang mi in Lantak Puai a tuah duh ve a si ahcun tuah ding le thlun ding timi daan vekin a thlun pei. Israel mi siseh, ramdang mi siseh, an thlun dingmi daan cu a bangrep thluh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa ih umnak Puanthlam an din ni ah mero a rung zaam ih Puanthlam cu a run zeel thluh. Zanvarte mero cu meisa vekin a tleu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cubangtuk ringring in a si: sunah mero in a khuh ih zanah cun meisa bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mero a kian tinte in Israel mi pawl cu an riahnak hmun an ṭhawn ih mero a rung zaam tinte in riahnak hmun an khuar sal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupeknak vekin Israel mi pawl cu an riahnak an ṭhawn ih a thupek vek thothoin an sak sal ṭheu. Puanthlam tlunih mero a zaam sung hmuahhmuah cu an riahbuk ah an caam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mero cu tikcu reipi ṭhawn loih a um tikah Bawipa ih duhnak an thlun ih ṭhawn loin an um ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Voikhat khat cu Puanthlam tlunah ni malte sung lawng mero a zaam; an riahnak hmunih an riah tikah siseh, an riahnak an ṭhawn tikah siseh, Bawipa ih duhnak vekin an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Voikhatkhat cu khuathim ihsin zinglam tiang lawng mero a zaam ih cuih mero a kian vete in an ceer ve ṭheu. Sun zan ti loin mero a kian tinin an riahnak cu an thawn ṭheu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni hnih siseh, thla khat siseh, a si lole kum khat sung khal siseh, Puanthlam parih mero a zaam sung hmuahhmuah cu an ṭhawn hrimhrim lo; asinain mero a kian vete cun an ṭhawn ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hmang in thu a pekmi pawl cu an thlun ruangah an riahnak cu an ṭhawn ih umhmun an khuar sal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“So ih sutmi ngun tawtawrawt pahnih na tuah pei ih Israel mi pawl pumkhawm kawhnak ah le riahhmun ṭhawn ding thannakah na hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tawtawrawt a pahnih in rei zet an phawt tikah misenpi an zatein ka umnak Puanthlam luhnak sangka ah an ra pumkhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain tawtawrawt pakhat lawng an phawt a si ahcun an hrin ciarih hotu pawl lawnglawng na hnenah an ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun ringzet le tawizet ih tawtawrawt an phawt tikah nisuahnak lamih a riakmi hrin pawl an ṭhawn pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule cubangtuk thothoin a voihnihnak ringzet le tawizet ih an phawt asile thlanglam ih a riakmi hrin pawl an ṭhawn pei. Curuangah riahnak ṭhawn ding ahcun ringzet le tawizet in tawtawrawt an phaw pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />misenpi tongkhawm ding ahcun reizet in an phaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tawtawrawt cu Aaron fapa puithiam pawl lawnglawng in an phaw pei. “A tanglamih daan pawl cu hmailamah nan tesinfa pawl tiang an thlun dingmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan ram sungih a lo neh-nentu ral pawl nan do tikah hi tawtawrawt pawl hi raldo tawtawrawt phawtin nan phaw pei. Bawipa nan Pathian keimah in ka lo bawm ding ih nan ral pawl ih kut ihsin ka lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun lungawi tikcu, thla thar caan ih nan Thla Thar Puai pawl le nan biaknak puai dangdang pawl hrangah siseh, mei-ur thawinak le remnak thawinak nan pek tik khalah siseh, hi tawtawrawt pawl cu nan phaw pei. Cuticun ka lo bawm hai ding. Keimah hi Bawipa nan Pathian ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt ram in an suah hnu kum hnihnak a thla hnihnak ni kul ni ah Bawipa umnak Puanthlam tlunih mero cu a kiang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Sinai nelrawn ihsin an suak. Cule Paran nelrawn an thlen in mero cu a cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses hnenih Bawipa thupekmi bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cu an ṭhawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Riahnak an ṭhawn tinin, Judah thantaar hnuai ih a ummi hmuahhmuah cu hmaisabik ah an feh; Judah hrin pawl hotu cu Amminadab fapa Nahshon a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Issakhar hrin pawl hotu cu Zuar ih fapa Nethanel a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zebulun hrin pawl hotu cu Helon ih fapa Eliab a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Puanthlam cu an ṭhet ih Gershon le Merari hrin pawl in an phur ih midang bangin an pok ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Reuben thantaar hnuai ih a ummi pawl an feh. Reuben hrin pawl hotu cu Shedeur ih fapa Elizur a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simeon hrin hotu cu Zurishaddai ih fapa Shelumiel a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad hrin hotu cu Deuel ih fapa Eliasaf a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Kohath hrin, thilri thianghlim pawl a phurtu cu an pok ve ih riahhmun an khuarnak an va thlen tikah cun Puanthlam cu din cia in a rak um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuṭhehin Efraim thantaar hnuai ih a ummi pawl an feh. Efraim hrin hotu cu Ammihud ih fapa Elishama a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manasseh hrin hotu cu Pedahzur ih fapa Gamaliel a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin hrin hotu cu Gideoni ih fapa Abidan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Neta bikah Dan thantaar hnuai ih a ummi pawl cu dunglamih ral kiltu-ah a bur a bur in an feh. Dan hrin hotu cu Ammishaddai ih fapa Ahiezer a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asher hrin hotu cu Okhran ih fapa Pagiel a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naftali hrin hotu cu Enan ih fapa Ahira a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an riahnak an ṭhawn ih a bur a burih an fehdan cu cuticun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Midian mi a pu Reuel ih fapa, a nupi ih ṭapa Hobab hnenah, “ Bawipa in pe dingih in tiammi ram ah kan feh thlang ding. Bawipa in Israel mi cu mineinung zet dingih tuah dingin thu in kam zo; curuangah kan hnenah ra ve awla kan lennak cu kan lo hlawm ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hobab cun, “Ka ra lo ding; ka ram le ka miphun hnenah ka kir sawn ding a si,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “In tlansan hram hlah aw. Hramlak ramṭhing kan thlen tikah riahnak hmun ṭha na thei sawn ding a si. Curuangah in hruai theitu na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kan hnenih na rat asile Bawipa ih in pekmi thlawsuahnak hmuahhmuah cu nangmah thawn kan hlawm aw ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel misenpi cu, tlang thianghlim Sinai tlang cun an pok ih ni thum ban khual lamhla-ah an feh. Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu an hmaiah a rak feh ih colhnak hmun a rak hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An riahnak hmun pakhat in pakhat ih an ṭhawn tikah Bawipa ih mero cu sunvu an tlunah a um ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cun Thukam Kuang cu riahhmun ihsin a ṭhawn tinte in Moses in, “Maw Bawipa , tho awla na ral pawl cu ṭhekdarh thluh hai aw; a lo huatu pawl cu na hmai ihsin tlanhlo thluh hai seh,” tiah a ti ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Kuang a colh tinin, “Maw Bawipa , Israel mi a thawng le a za hnenah hin ra kir hram aw,” tiah a ti ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl harsatnak an tuar ruangah Bawipa ih parah an phunzai ciamco. Cutiih an phunzainak cu Bawipa in a theih tikah a thin a heng ih an parah mei-alh a run thlak. An lakah meisa cu a alh ih an riahnak kap hmun khat a kang ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misenpi cu bomnak dil in Moses hnenah an au. Moses cun Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih meisa cu a mit sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutiin Bawipa ih meisa an lakih a alh ruangah cuih hmun cu Taberah tiah an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi pawl lakih a feh vemi ram dangmi hrekkhat cu sa an hiar ngaingai. Anmah Israel mi lala khal cu an tlok an ciar ih, “Sa ei ding um sehla maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt ramah cun ngasa tla a lak in kan ngah sikhawh. Kan ei ṭheu mi fanghma pawl, kawl fanghma pawl, tlang purun pawl, khasuansen le khasuanrang pawl tla kan vun ngai ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain atu ahcun kan tha a cem; kan caar cuahco. Ei ding ziang hman a um lo; ni khat hnu ni khat manna lawnglawng, manna lawnglawng,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manna cu thlaici fate vek a si ih a pianzia cu a rang nawn, aihre nawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A cuih manna cu Israel misenpi pawl in an va khawm ih phut ko in an rial, a si lole sum ah an den ih an suan hnuah sangphak ah an tuah. A thawtdan cu olif siti thawn rawhmi sang vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manna cu an riahhmun ih zandai a tlak tikah a tla vemi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misenpi pawl an riahbuk sangka ciarah ding tahratih an phunzai rero kha Moses in a thei. Bawipa cu an parah a thin a heng. Moses cu a riah a sia ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah, “Zianghrangah so na salpa kei hi hiti lawmmam ih i ti siat? Ziangah so na mithmai ṭha ka co thei lo? Ziangah so hi minung pawl kilkhawi ding thilrit hi ka phurh dingah ka parih na thlenter?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi minung pawl hringtu ka si lo ih seemtertu khal ka si lo. Nau umtu in naute a baan ih a cawi ringring vekin ziang hrangah so hi minung pawl hi an pupa pawl hnenih na kam ciami ramtiam tiang cawi dingah i fial?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minung hizat hrangah hin sa cu khuitawk in so ka laak cawk ding? Cat loin an raak an kio ih sa an ngen ringring fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fiangtein ka lo sim: minung hizat hrangah keimah lawng cun ṭuanvo ka la cawk lo a si. Ka thil a rit tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiti thotho ding a si ahcun i ti siatnak ihsin ka luat theinak dingah i zaangfah awla hmakhatte-ah i that lawlaw aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Miseenpi lakih rinsan tlak le zum tlak hruaitu sawm sarih ko khawm in ka umnak Puanthlam ah ratpi hai awla na kiangah ding hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka rungṭum pei ih nangmah thawn kan bia-aw ding ih ka lo pek ciami thlarau cu na hnen ihsin a hrekkhat ka la pei ih an hnenah ka pe ding. Cuticun hi misenpi pawl kilkhawinak thilrit cu an lo sawng pei ih nangmah lawngin na phur nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah misenpi pawl cu, ‘Thaisun hrangah thianfai-aw hai seh; sa ei ding nan ngah thlang ding. Nan ṭahnak le sa ei nan hiar ih nan ngennak le, “Izipt ramah cun sa kan khopzet naón, nan tinak pawl cu Bawipa in a thei a si. Atu ah Bawipa in sa a lo pe hai ding ih sa ei ding nan ngah thlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sa ei ding cu ni khat, ni hnih, ni nga, ni hra, a si lole ni kul sung, lawng si loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a lo ngei ih nan luak a suak neknek tiangin thla khat pumhlum sung nan ei ding. Ziangahtile Bawipa Pathian nan hnong ih a theih hngan rori-ah Izipt ram ihsin rak suak lo ding kan si naón, ti-ih nan phunzai ruangah a si,’ tiah sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Moses in Bawipa hnenah, “Atu tiang ka hruaimi misenpi hi thawng zaruk an si. Thla khat sung an khop ei dingah sa ka pe hai ding na ti maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Caw le tuu pawl an khop in thah ding a um cawk ding maw? Tifinriat ih nga hmuahhmuah hman an khop pei maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Ka huham le ka cah-nak hin ti thei lomi a nei maw si? Ka ṭong vekih a can ngaingai le can ngaingai lo cu rei lo te-ah na hmu mai ding,” tiah Moses cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Moses cu a suak ih Bawipa ih simmi pawl cu misenpi hnenah a sim sal. Hruaitu sawm sarih pawl cu Puanthlam kimvelah cun a pumkhawmter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa cu mero sungin a rung ih Moses hnenah cun thu a run sim. Moses hnenih a pek zomi thlarau hrekkhat cu a lak ih hruaitu sawm sarih pawl hnenah a pek. An hnenih thlarau a thlen vete cun profet vekin an ṭong celcel. Asinain cumicu a rei hlanah a reh sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hruaitu sawm sarih lakih a tel vemi pahnih Eldad le Medad cu Puanthlam ah feh loin an riahnak ah an rak um. Cutawk an riahbuk ahcun an hnenah thlarau cu a thleng ih hmakhatte ah profet vekin an ṭong ciamco ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eldad le Medad umdan cu tlangval pakhat in a hmu ih a va tlan ih Moses a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah a no lai ihsin Moses bawmtu a si ringring mi Nun ih fapa Joshua cun Moses hnenah, “Ka bawipa, cute pahnih cu kham hai aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Ka hrangah ziang a cang pei ti lawng na ruat maw si? Aw, Bawipa in a minung pawl ih parah a thlarau cu thlengter in an zatein profet bangin ṭong thluh hai sehla ti ka va duh so!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Moses le Israel hruaitu sawm sarih pawl cu an riahnak ah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rin lopi-ah Bawipa in thli a hranter ih tifinriat lam in vanim pawl cuih thli cun leilung ihsin pi thum sangin a rak hranpi ih an riahhmun ihsin nisuahnak lam, nitlaknak lam, saklam, thlanglam, ni khat thlen ban sung hmuahhmuah cu vanim hlir an ril teptep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah misenpi pawl cu a cuih sun in a thaisun tiang a sun a zan it lo siing loin vanim an khawm. Minung pakhat hman haan sawmnga hnakih mal sartu an um lo. An riahhmun ih kimvel ah caar dingin an pho ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an vanimsa a cem hlan, ei ding tampi an neih laiah, misenpi parah Bawipa cu a thin a heng ih an parah pulhnat a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sa a hiartu mi tampi cu cutawkah phum an si ruangah cutawk hmun cu Hibroth Hataavah tiah an ko; a tican cu Hiarnak Thlan ti ai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin misenpi cu an suak ih Hazeroth an timi an thleng ih cutawkah riahhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hazeroth ih an um laiah cun, Moses in Kush nunau a ṭhit; curuangah Miriam le Aaron in Moses cu an thangsiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annih in, “ Bawipa cu Moses hnen lawng in maw thu a sim? Kannih hnen in teh a sim ve lo maw si?” an ti. Cutiih an ti cu Bawipa in a thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses cu mitangdor zetmi a si ih leilung tlunah amah tluk mitangdor zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmakhatteah Bawipa cun Moses le Aaron le Miriam hnenah, “Nan pathum in ka umnak Puanthlam ah ra hnik uh,” a ti. An va feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu mero zual sungin a runglang ih Puanthlam sangka ahcun a ding ih, “Aaron! Miriam!” tiah a ko. An pahnih cun hmaiah an va suak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ka ṭong hi ciing ṭha uh! Nanmah ih lakih profet an um tikah an hnenah langnak in ka lang ih an mangah thu ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Moses cu ka miphun Israel mi pawl kilkhawitu-ah ṭuanvo ka pek ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />anih hnen ahcun hmaitonte rori in ka ṭong a si; thupolh in ka ṭong lo, fiangzet le tluangzet in ka ṭong a si. Ka pianhmang hman a hmu zo a si. Cutluk ih ka milai a si mi Moses cu ziangtinso nan thangsiat ngam?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa cun an parah thinheng ngaingai in a feh santa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule mero cu Puanthlam ihsin a hlitih, cu vete in Miriam cu phaarnat in a khat ih a vun tla cu vur bangin a rang thluh. Aaron in Miriam cu a zoh ih phaarnat in a khat ṭheh a si ti a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Aaron in Moses hnenah, “Ka bawipa, in zaangfah hram awla, aat-thlakza thil sual kan tuah zo naón kan sual man cu in tuarter siang hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thicia in a nuih pumsung in a suak ih a taksa hrekkhat a ṭawt thluh zomi naute bangtuk ah Miriam cu canter hram hlah aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Bawipa cu a ko ih, “Maw Bawipa , zaangfahte in Miriam hi run damter hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Thuṭhimnak ah a pa in a fanu ih hmai cil in phui sehla, ni sarih sung ningzak in a um ding a si lo maw? Cubangin nan riahhmun lengah Miriam cu ni sarih sung suah uh, cuih hnuah nan lak sal leh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ti bangin Miriam cu an riahhmun lengah ni sarih sung an suah ih an lak kir sal hlan lo misenpi cu ṭhawn loin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Hazeroth hmun ihsin an suak ih Paran hramlak ramṭhingah riahhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel miphun hleihnih sungin phun khatah hruaitu pakhat ciar hril awla ka pek hai dingmi Kanaan ram zoh dingah le thlingthla dingah thlah aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vekin Moses cun a tuah ih a tanglam Israel mi lakih hruaitu pawl cu an riahhmun Paran in a thlah hai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Reuben hrin in Zakkur ih fapa Shammua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon hrin in Hori ih fapa Shafat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah hrin in Jefunneh ih fapa Kaleb,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Issakhar hrin in Josef ih fapa Igal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efraim hrin in Nun ih fapa Hoshea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Benjamin hrin in Rafu ih fapa Palti,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebulun hrin in Sodi ih fapa Gaddiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manasseh hrin in Susi ih fapa Gaddi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan hrin in Gemalli ih fapa Ammiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asher hrin in Mikhael ih fapa Sethur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naftali hrin in Vofsi ih fapa Nahbi, le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad hrin in Makhi ih fapa Geuel, pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi pawl cu Moses in Kanaan ram zoh dingih a thlahmi an si. Nun fapa ih hmin Hoshea cu Joshua ah Moses in a thleng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutiin Moses ih a thlah tikah an hnenah, “Kanaan ram sung thlanglam ah hung feh uhla, cuih hnuah an tlangram ah hung feh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An ram cu ziangbangtuk ram a si, minung ziangzat an um, a ummi pawl cu micak an si maw si lo, ti pawl ṭhatein nan zingzoi pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An ram cu ram ṭha a si maw si lo, ti le mi pawl cu khawte ah maw ralhruang kulhmi khawpi ah so an um, ti pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cule an ram cu a leilung a ṭha maw, cun tupi teh a um maw, a si lole leenkolh a tam maw, ti pawl ṭhatein nan zoh pei. Cun an ramih a rahmi thingrah hrekkhat cu nan run keng tengteng pei,” tiah thu a cah. Cuih tikcu cu sabit rah hmin tikcu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel hruaitu pawl cu an feh ih Kanaan ram cu an hung zoh. An ram thlanglam ih a ummi Zin timi nelrawn ihsin saklam ih Hamath Tlangkawn kiangih Rehob tiang an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih sin an feh lala ih Anakim timi mitum zetzet pawl ih cithlah Ahiman, Sheshai le Talmai pawl ih sungkhat pawl an umnak Hebron khua an thleng. Hebron cu Izipt ramih Zoan khua an tlak hlan kum sarih ih tlakmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Eshkhol Phairawn an thleng ih cutawkah bawr khat a rahmi sabit cu a hnge in an tan ih a rihzet ruangah minung pahnih in fung in an zawn. Taleti le thei khal an lo ih an phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutawk hmun cu Israel hruaitu pawl ih sabit bawr khat an sahnak a si ruangah Eshkhol Phairawn tiah hmin an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kanaan ram cu ni sawmli sung an zoh hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moses le Aaron le Israel misenpi rak umnak Paran nelrawnih an riahnak hmun Kadesh ahcun an ra thleng. An hmuhmi hmuahhmuah cu an sim ih an rak phurhmi thingrah pawl cu an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moses hnenah, “Zoh dingih in thlahmi ram cu kan va zoh ih cawhnawi le khuaitizu in a khatmi ram a si. Thingrah pawl tla hinah kan rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Asinain cutawkih a ummi pawl cu micakzet an si. An khawpi tla cu an tum zetzet ih ralhruang ih kulhmi fekfek an si. Cuih tlunah mikei vekih mitum zetzet pawl tla kan hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amalek mi pawl cu an ram thlanglam ah an um. Hit mi, Jebus mi le Amor mi pawl cu tlangpar ram ah an um ih Kanaan mi pawl cu Mediterranean Tifinriat kiangah le Jordan Tiva kap tluanah an um,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Moses hmaiah misenpi pawl cu an phunzai ciamco. Cutikah Kaleb in dai koin a tuah hnuah, “Cumi pawl cu atu rori ah kan do pei ih an ram cu kan lak mai ding. Anmah neh dingah cun kan cakzet pam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Kaleb thawn a feh vemi Israel hruaitu pawl cun, “Sihlah ee, annih do dingah kan cak lamlam lo; kannih hnakin an cak deuh ngaingai a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutiin an va zohmi ram thu cu Israel misenpi hnenah thinnau dingin a dik lo zawng in an sim. Annih in, “Kan hung thlingthlakmi ram cu an ram sung minung pawl hman a dolhthluhtu ram a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kan hmuhmi minung hmuahhmuah cu mitum le misang zetzet an si ih Anak ih tesinfa pawl tla cu mikei an si ko. Kannih tla cu an hnenah cun kharbok tluk fang kan si ih annih ih in hmuhnak khalah cu thotho kan si ko ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel misenpi pawl cu an riahsia in zanvar an ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses le Aaron parah an phunzai ih, “Izipt ramah khan rak thih sawn taak ding. Culo talle hramlak ahhin thi sawn nungna a ṭha ding naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangah so Bawipa in hi ram ahhin in thlenpi ngelcel? Ral ah kan thi thluh ding ih kan nupi le kan faate pawl tla ral in an kai thluh ding a si. Izipt ram ah kir sal sehla a ṭha sawn lo ding maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule pakhat le pakhat, “Izipt ramih in hruai kirtu dingah hotu kan hril pei,” an ti-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Moses le Aaron cu Israel mi misenpi hmaiah an bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Kanaan ram zoh dingih an thlahmi lakih a tel vemi pahnih, Nun ih fapa Joshua le Jefunneh ih fapa Kaleb cu an riahsiat tukah an hnipuan an thlek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel misenpi hnenah cun, “Kan va zohmi ram cu ram ṭha ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa cu kan parih a lung a awi a si ahcun Amah in in hruai ding ih cawhnawi le khuaitizu in a khatmi ram cu in thlenpi ding ih in pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu dodal hlah uhla cutawk ramih a ummi pawl tla cu ṭih hlah uh. Olte in kan neh ko ding. Bawipa cu kan hnenah a um ih anmah humhimtu an khawzing pawl cu a siatsuah thluh zo a si. Ṭih hrimhrim hlah uh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain Israel misenpi pawl cun anmah riangri cu lungto in den that an tum. Sikhalsehla rin lopi-ah misenpi in Bawipa ih huham tleu kha Puanthlam tlunih a lang kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Hi minung pawl in ziangtik tiangso in nautat ding? An lakah mangbangza tampi ka tuah zo naón keimah rinsan duh loin ziangtik tiangso an um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pulhnat natsia ka tlunter ding ih ka siatsuah thluh hai ding. Anmah hnakih lian deuh le cak deuh miphun pakhat ka seemter ding ih nangmah hi an pa na si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Bawipa ih hnenah, “Nangmah ih cahnak huham in himi pawl cu Izipt ram ihsin na rak suahpimi an si. Na minung pawl parih thil na tuahmi hi Izipt mi pawl in an rak hmu zo sikhawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hi ramih a ummi hnenah an sim ko ding. Bawipa nangmah cu kan hnenah na um ih nangmah ih mero cu kan tlunah cawl tahratin langhngan ih in umpi zia cu hi ram minung pawl in an thei zo. Cuih tlunah sunah mero zual, zanah meisa tom ih in hruai ringring ṭheu hi an theih thluh zomi a si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cubangtuk hnu ih na minung pawl na thah thluh hai a si ahcun na hmin a lo theitu miphun hmuahhmuah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘An Pathian in a minung pawl cu a tiam ciami ram ah thlenpi thei loin hramlakah a that thluh hai a si,’ tiah an lo ti pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa , nang cun ‘Thinheng ol mi ka si lo, duhdawtnak neimi ka si, rinsan tlak ka si, sualnak le dodalnak ngaithiamtu ka si ih pupa sin sual ruangah san thum san li tiang an tesinfa pawl tlolh loih a hremtu ka si fawn,’ tiih na rak ti vek khan, maw Bawipa , na huham le na thiltitheinak cu run langter awla in tiamciami cu kimter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izipt ramih an suah thok ihsin tuihsun tiang na ngaithiam hai bangtuk in, a thukmi le a thleng-aw dah lomi na duhdawtnak in hi na minung pawl cu ngaithiam hram hai aw,” tiah zaangfah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “I dil bangtuk in ka ngaithiam hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a nungmi Pathian ka si ih ka sunlawinak huham in leilung cu a khuh thluh ruangah ka hmin in thu ka lo kam:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kanaan ram an luh tikah himi pawl cu zohman a nungmi an um lo ding. Izipt ram ah siseh, hramlak nelrawn ah siseh, mangbangza ka tuah mi le ka sunlawinak tleuvar cu an hmu ṭheh ko naón in rinsan lo ih in zum duh hrimhrim lo. Keimah sawn voisawm le voiza in hniksak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An pu le an pa hnenih ka kam ciami ram cu an thleng hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain ka salpa Kaleb cu a ruahnak phundangte a si ih a thinlung zatein i thlun a si. Curuangah a va zohmi ram cu ka thlengter ding ih a tesinfa pawl in cuih ram cu an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amalek mi le Kanaan mi pawl an umnak phairawn tla cu an ta a si ding. Thaisun in nan dung nan let pei ih Tipi Sen lam zawh in hramlak nelrawn ah nan feh kir pei,” tiah Moses cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ziangtik tiangso hi miṭha lo pawl hi ka parah an phunzai ding? An tlawhciarnak hi ka thei tamtuk zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah an hnenah, ‘A nungmi Pathian ka si ih siatcam in thu ka lo kam: Ka hnenih nan dil vek cekci in nan parah ka tuah ding. Bawipa a si mi keimah in ka ṭong zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nan thi ding ih hi hramlak ahhin nan ruak pawl cu ṭhekdarh thluh an si ding. Ka parih nan phunzai ruangah nan lakih kum kul tlun minung zohman Kanaan ram nan thleng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi ram co dingah thu ka rak lo kam. Asinain Kaleb le Joshua siar lo pakhat hman nan thleng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ral in kan faate pawl an kai thluh pang ding nan ti. Asinain cuih nan faate pawl riangri cu nan duh lo taak ram ahcun ka thlenpi thluh hai dingih an ram ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nannih cu hi hramlak ahhin nan thi thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nan zate nan thih thluh hlan lo nan faate pawl cu hi ramṭhing ahhin kum sawmli sung an vakvai ding ih cuticun nan zuanzam man an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kanaan ram nan va zoh ni zat, ni khat ai ah kum khat in, ni sawmli hrangah kum sawmli sung nan sualman nan tuar ding ih keimah dodal a harzia cu nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keimah dodaltu miṭha lo senpi pawl nan par hrimhrim ah a tlun ih hremnak pawl cu ka tlunter hrimhrim ding, tiah siatcam in thu ka lo kam a si. Hi ramṭhing ah hin pakhat hman luat loin nan thi thluh ding. Bawipa keimah in ka sim zo,’ a ti, tiah nan sim pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Moses in Kanaan ram thlingthla dingih a thlahmi hruaitu pawl in thusia an sim ruangah misenpi pawl Bawipa ih parih an phunzainak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Curuangah Moses ih a thlahmi hruaitu pawl parah natsia a thleng ih an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thlingthlatu minung hleihnih sungah Joshua le Kaleb lawng an nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moses in Bawipa thusimmi hmuahhmuah cu Israel mi hnenih a sim tikah napi in an ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cule a thaizing cu tlangpar ram ah an hung feh ih, “Kan sual zo ngai a si. Atu cun Bawipa ih in tiammi ram ah kan feh thlang ko pei,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Asinain Moses cun, “Ziangah so atu khalah Bawipa ih thu cu nan thlun duh lo? Zianghman nan si cuang lo ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Feh hlah uh. Bawipa cu nan hnenah a um lo ih nan ral pawl in an lo neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khitawk ah Amalek mi le Kanaan mi thawn nan do awk tikah nan thi thluh mai ding. Bawipa ih thu thlun nan duh lo ruangah Amah cu nan hnenah a um hrimhrim lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sikhalsehla feh an tum thotho. Asinain Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang siseh, amah Moses siseh, an riahhmun ihsin an pok lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cutikah cutawkih a rak ummi Amalek mi le Kanaan mi pawl cun an rak nam hai ih an run neh ih Hormah khua tiang Israel pawl cu an run dawi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a tiam ciami ram an thlen tikih Israel mi pawl thlun dingah a tanglam daan pawl hi a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mei-ur thawinak siseh, thukam-awh kimter thawinak siseh, mah lungtho teih pekmi thawinak siseh, biaknak puai tikcu ih thawinak siseh, Bawipa hnenih nan pek tikah cawcang, a si lole tuu, a si lole me, nan pek pei. Hi pekmi meisa thawn thawinak pawl cu Bawipa ih hrangah rim thawmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah cubangtuk thawinak a petu hmuahhmuah in olif siti khuat khat thawn rawi mi sangphut cuai hrek in thlairawl thawinak khal an pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinakah tuucangte a pek tinin sabitti khuat khat cu inmi thawinak ah a pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun an pekmi cu tuucang asile, inmi thawinakah sabit khuat khat le a hrek, thlairawl thawinak ah olif siti khuat khat le a hrek thawn rawi mi sangphut cuai khat khal a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bangtuk thawinak pekmi cu Bawipa ih hrangah a thawmi rimhmui a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ih hnenah cawcang cu mei-ur thawinak ah siseh, thukam-awh kimter thawinak ah siseh, mah lungtho teih pekmi thawinakah siseh, a pek tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thlairawl thawinak ah olif siti khuat hnih thawn rawimi sangphut cuai khat, inmi thawinak ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabit khuat hnih khal a pek cih pei. Hi thawinak cu Bawipa ih hnenah a thawmi rimhmui a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thawinak ah cawcang siseh, tuucang siseh, tuu le me siseh, an pek tikah hi a tlunih thil pawl cu pek cih vivo an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule ṭilva pakhat hnakih tam deuh an pek a si ahcun a tam zat in thilri dang pekmi pawl cu ṭhan an si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram sung minung hmuahhmuah in Bawipa hnenih a rim a thawmi thlairawl thawinak an pek tikah a tlun ih tuah ding pawl cu an tuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule ramdangmi pakhatkhat in, a laangte ih a um ah siseh, kumkhua in nan lakih a um ah siseh, Bawipa hnenih rimthaw thlairawl thawinak a pek a si ahcun a tlunih daan pawl cu a thlun ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanmah siseh, ramdangmi nan lakih a ummi siseh, hi daan pawl cu sanmureng tiang nan thlun dingmi a si. Nanmah le anmah cu Bawipa hmaiah nan bangrep a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan hrangah siseh, an hrangah siseh, daan le thiltidan cu a bangrep a si, tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ih pekmi ram an thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih an thlun dingah a tanglam ih daan pawl cu Bawipa in Moses hnenah a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutawk ramih a suakmi rawl an ei tikah rawl hrekkhat cu Bawipa hnenah a dangte in laksawngah an pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumtin rawl an lak ṭheh tikah, fangtharih tuahmi sang zawl khat cu Bawipa ih hnenah laksawngah an pek pei. Himi cu fang an ciilmi sungin laksawngih an pek ṭheu vekin an pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fang an lak ṭheh ih sangphut an tuahmi sung ihsin hi laksawng cu Bawipa ih hnenah a kumkhua in an pek ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa keimah in Moses hnenih ka pekmi daan pawl hi mi pakhatkhat in tumhrimnak nei loin a thlun lo pang tikah siseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hmailam ni khat khatah Bawipa ih thupekmi hi Israel misenpi in thlun loin an um tikah siseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />misenpi in thutheih lo ruangih an tuah pangmi a si ahcun, mei-ur thawinakah cawcang an pek pei. Himi cu Bawipa hnenih pekmi rimthaw a si ih thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak thawn an pek cih pei. Cuih tlunah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang khal an pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misenpi hrangah mawhnak thawinak cu puithiam in a tuah pei ih ngaihthiam an si ding. Ziangahtile tihrimmi si loin tipangmi a si ih sualthlah thawinak le mei-ur thawinak Bawipa hnenih an pekmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih thilti sualmi-ah an zate ih an tel ruangah Israel misenpi siseh, an lakih um ramdangmi siseh, ngaithiam thluh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi pakhat in pumpak in sualnak a tuah pang a si ahcun a sualthlah thawinakah kum khat ti menu a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa ih mithmuh ah a sualnak ihsin thianter dingah mawhnak thawinak cu puithiam in a tuah sak pei ih amah cu ngaithiam a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi daan cu Israel mi siseh, hrindangmi siseh, ramsungmi hmuahhmuah in, thil an tipang tikah thlun dingmi daan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi siseh, ramdangmi siseh, ramsungih ummi pawl in tihrim sualnak an tuah ih Bawipa an hmuhsuam a si ahcun thah an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa ih ṭongmi thu cu an duh lo ih a thupekmi cu an pah hrim ruangah an thihnak cu a si, tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Voikhat cu Israel mi pawl hramlak nelrawnih an um laiah mipa pakhat Sabbath ni ah zanthing a khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amah cu an kai ih Moses le Aaron le misenpi hmaiah an suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ziang tuah ding an theih ve lo ruangah annih in thawngah an khum ih an kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Sabbath buartu cu thah ding a si. Riahhmun lengah nan suahpi pei ih misenpi in lungto in deng that hai seh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Curuangah riahhmun lengah an fehpi ih Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk in amah cu lungto in an deng ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses cu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel mi hnenih sim dingah thu a pek ih, “Nan hnipuan ziik ah a fem nan thlaih pei ih a fem tinah mepian pat nan ṭelh pei. Cumi cu nan tesinfa tiang nan tuah dingmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hi puanfeem nan hmuh tinte in ka thupekmi hmuahhmuah nan thei sal ding ih nan thlun ding. Cuticun nan zuanzamnak, nan thinlung hiarnak, le nan mit ih hmuhmi poh nan tuah duhnak tla suup-aw tahratin keimah cu in dungtun lo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka thupekmi hmuahhmuah a lo mangter ding ih keimah ih ta hrimhrim nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keimah hi Bawipa nan Pathian ka si. Nan Pathian si dingah Izipt ram ihsin a lo suahtu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si. Keimah cu Bawipa ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi hrin Kohath sungkhat Izhar ih fapa Korah cu a fim-awter ih Moses a dodal. Amah cu Reuben hrin Eliab ih fapa pahnih Dathan le Abiram, le Peleth ih fapa On in an thlun. Cuih tlunah misenpi ih hrilmi mi hminthang Israel mi zahnih le sawmnga pawl khal in an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses le Aaron hmaiah cun an ra ih, “Nan luantuk a si! Kan zatein Bawipa ta kan si ih Bawipa cu kan zate hnenah a um a si. Ziangah so Bawipa ih minung pawl ih tlunah nan cuan hleice?” tiah an zuam hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cumi cu Moses in a theih tikah leilung ah bok tahrat in thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Moses in Korah le a dungthluntu pawl hnenah, “Thaizing ah Bawipa in amah ih minung a si mi cu in hliah ding; amah ih minung a si mi le amah hrangih a hril ciami pawl cu biakṭheng ah a ratter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thaizing zingpitah nangmah le na dungthluntu pawl in mei laknak kheng nan keng pei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />meiling nan lak pei ih a parah rimhmui nan ret hnuah biakṭheng ah nan keng pei. Cutikah zoso Bawipa in in hril, ti cu kan hmu ding. A luan tukmi cu nanmah Levi mi sawn nan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Moses in Korah hnen ahcun, “Levi fapa pawl, ngai uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah kiangih nan rat theinak dingah le Bawipa ih Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuantu nan sinak dingah le misenpi hrangih hna nan ṭuannak dingah Pathian in Israel misenpi sung ihsin a dangte ih a lo hrilnak hi thil tenau-ah mawsi nan ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in amah ih kiangih naihtu dingah nangmah le Levi mi pawl cu a lo hril zo a si. Atu-ah puithiam hnaṭuan laak nan tum lala!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aaron parih nan phunzai hi a ngaingai cun nangmah le na dungthluntu pawl in Bawipa nan dodal a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Moses in Dathan le Abiram cu a ko, asinain annih in, “Kan ra lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hitawk ramṭhing le ramcaar lakih thi dingah Izipt ram, cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram ihsin in suahpi hi a tawk zo lo maw si? Cuih tlunah maw kan tlunih na bawi duh hrih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cawhnawi le khuaitizu in a khatmi ram cu in thlenpi lo-ih, lo le sabit hmuan khal kan co dingah in pe fawn lo; a bum lawnglawng in tum rero a si lo maw? Kan ra naisai lo ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Moses cu a ai a thok ih Bawipa hnenah, “Himi pawl ih an lo pekmi thawinak pawl cu zianghman saang hlah aw. An laak pakhatte hman ka lak sak dah lo. Ka tisiatmi pakhat hman an um hrih lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Moses in Korah hnenah, “Thaisun ah nangmah le a lo thluntu minung zahnih le sawmnga cu Bawipa ih Puanthlam ah nan ra pei. Cunah Aaron khal a ra ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mei laknak kheng nan keng ciar pei ih a parah rimhmui nan ret hnuah Bawipa ih mithmuh ah nan pek pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah an mei laknak kheng cu an keng ciar ih meiling an ret hnuah a parah rimhmui cu ret in Puanthlam sangka ahcun Moses le Aaron thawn an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun Korah in misenpi pawl cu a kokhawm ih Puanthlam sangka ah Moses le Aaron hmaihoih in an ding. Cule hmakhatte-ah Bawipa ih huham cu tleunak in misenpi hnenah a rung lang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses le Aaron hnenah Bawipa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nannih cu dungah siip uhla himi pawl hi atu rori-ah ka siatsuah thluh hai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Moses le Aaron cu leilungah an bok ih, “Maw Pathian, nang cu nunnak hmuahhmuahih hramṭoh-nak na si. Mi pakhat a sual tikah misenpi parah na thin a heng ding maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Seenpi pawl cu Korah, Dathan le Abiram pawl ih deuthlam ihsin ṭhawn dingah sim hai aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Moses cu Israel hotu pawl in an thlun ih Dathan le Abiram hnenah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule misenpi hnenah cun, “Hi misuaksual pawl ih deuthlam ihsin tlan uh; an thilri zianghman a dai in dai hlah uh. Culole an sual ruangah anmah thawn nannih khal siatsuah thluh nan si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah Korah, Dathan, le Abiram ih deuthlam ihsin misenpi pawl cu an tlan. Dathan le Abiram cu an nupi le an faate pawl thawn an ra suak ih an deuthlam sangka ah an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule Moses in senpi hnen ahcun, “Hi thil tuah dingah Bawipa in i thlah. Keimah ih duhnak in ka tuah mi a si lo, ti cu himi hin nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi minung pawl hi Pathian hnen ihsin hremnak zianghman tong loin mahte thih ih an thih a si ahcun Bawipa ih thlahmi ka si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla leilung par minung ih theih dah lomi thil Bawipa in a tuah ih leilung kak in an neihmi zate thawn a dolh thluh hai ih an nungcung in mithi khua Sheol ah an feh a si ahcun hi minung pawl in Bawipa an hnon ruangah a si, ti nan thei ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutiih a ti ṭheh vete in Dathan le Abiram an dinnak leilung cu a kak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />anmah le an innsang pawl le Korah dungthluntu pawl le an thilri hmuahhmuah pawl thawn a dolh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuticun an nungcung in an thilri pawl thawn mithi khua ah an lut. An tlunih leilung cu a ciip-aw sal ih an hlota.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An ṭah le an ai kha cutawk kiangkapih Israel mi pawl in an theih tikah an tlan ciamco ih, “Tlan uh, zaam uh; leilung in in dolh thluh ve ding,” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in mei-alh a run thlak ih rimhmui thawinak a petu zahnih le sawmnga pawl cu a kaang that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Puithiam Aaron ih fapa Eleazar cu sim awla mei laknak darkheng pawl cu a thianghlimmi a si ruangah meisa ih a kang thatmi miruak vutcam umnak ihsin kheng pawl cu lak in meiling pawl cu hmun dangah ṭhekdarh thluh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawipa ih biakṭheng ih peknak an tuah tikah hi kheng pawl cu thilri thianghlim ah an cang a si. Curuangah an sual ruangih thihnak a tuartu pawl ih mei laknak kheng cu la awla pakan bangtuk in peer ko in deng aw. Cule biakṭheng khuhah tuah aw. Israel mi pawl in ralrinnak ah an hmang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ti bangtuk in puithiam Eleazar in mei laknak kheng pawl cu a lak ih pakan peerah a deen ih biakṭheng khuhah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Himi cu Aaron hrin siar lo zohman Bawipa ih biakṭheng ah ra tahratin rimhmui an ur thei lo pei, ti ralrin ternak a si. A tuahtu an um asile Korah le a minung pawl vekin siatsuah an tong ding a si. Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in hi a tlunih tuah ding pawl cu Eleazar in a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thaisun ah Israel misenpi pawl cu Moses le Aaron parah an phunzai ih an hnenah, “Nanmah in Bawipa ih minung hrekkhat pawl nan that a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An tongkhawm aw ih Moses le Aaron parih an phunzai thluh hnuah Puanthlam lam an hei zoh ih mero in Puanthlam cu a tuam ih Bawipa ih huham tleu a lang kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutikah Moses le Aaron an feh ih Puanthlam hmaiah cun an ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bawipa in an hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Hi minung pawl hnen ihsin dungah siip uh; hmakhatte-ah ka siatsuah thluh hai ding,” a ti. Cutikah leilung ah an bok ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moses in Aaron hnenah, “Na mei laknak kheng keng awla a sungah biakṭheng ih meiling ret in meilingvam parah cun rimhmui thlak aw. Cule misenpi hnenah zamrangin feh awla an hrangah mawhnak thawinak tuah aw. Zamrang aw! Bawipa ih thinhengnak a thok zo ih pulhnat a thleng zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A ti vek cun Aaron in a tuah ih a mei laknak kheng a keng ih misenpi lak ahcun a va tlan. Pulhnat in an na zo, ti a hmuh tikah khulrangin meilingvam parah rimhmui cu a thlah ih misenpi hrangah mawhnak thawinak cu a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cumi in pulhnat cu a rehter ih mithi le minung karlakah Aaron cu a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Korah ralthawh ṭumih a thimi pawl siar loin hi pulhnat ih a thimi cu thawng hleili le za sarih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Pulhnat a reh tikah Aaron cu Puanthlam sangka kiang Moses hnenah cun a kir sal.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl sim awla hrin khatah kianghrol pakhat ciar in kianghrol hleihnih lo pe hai seh. An kianghrol parah an hmin ciar ngan awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi hrin kianghrol parah Aaron ih hmin ngan aw. An hrin hotu pakhat hrangah kianghrol pakhat ciar a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih kianghrol pawl cu ka umnak Puanthlam sung, ka lo ton ṭheunak Thukam Kuang hmaiah ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule ka hril mipa ih kianghrol cu a cerh ding. Cuticun Israel mi pawl ih phunzai ringringnak hi ka kham thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cun Israel mi pawl cu a sim ih an hotu ciar in kianghrol pakhat ciar, hrin hleihnih hrangah kianghrol hleihnih, Moses an pek. Aaron ih kianghrol khal a tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses in kianghrol hmuahhmuah cu Puanthlam sung, Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang hmaiah cun a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thaisun ah Puanthlam sungah Moses cu a lut ih Levi hrin ai-awhtu Aaron ih kianghrol a cerh kha a hmu. A cerh lawng si loin a mum hnuah a par ih almon a hminmi almon rah a rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in kianghrol zatein a lak ih Israel mi pawl hnenah a hmuh. Cutiih thil a cangmi an hmuh hnuah hotu pawl cun anmah an ta ciar an lak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Aaron ih kianghrol cu Thukam Kuang hmaiah ret sal aw. An phunzainak an baan lo ahcun mi dodaltu Israel mi cu an thi ding, tiih ralrin ternak ah ret ringring ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vekin Moses cun a tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cun Moses hnenah, “Kan cem a si. Kan thi cem thluh ding a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puanthlam kiangih a ra menmenmi a thih ahcun kan cem riai a si. Pakhatte hman taang loin maw kan cimih thluh ding!” an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Aaron hnenah, “Ka umnak Puanthlam sungih hna thiang nan ṭuannak nan mawh man cu nangmah le na fapa pawl le na phunpi Levi pawl in nan tuar ding. Asinain puithiam nan ṭuannak ih nan mawh man cu nangmah le na fapa pawl lawngin nan tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah le na fapa pawl in Puanthlam sungih hna nan ṭuan tikah nangmah thawn ṭuan tlang dingah le a lo bawmtu dingah Levi hrin na sungkhat pawl cu lutter ve aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah hnenih an neihmi ṭuanvo siseh Puanthlam hrangih an neihmi ṭuanvo siseh, an ṭuan suak pei. Sikhalsehla Hmun Thianghlim le biakṭheng ih thilri thiang pawl cu an dai hrimhrim lo pei. An dai asile anmah siseh, nanmah siseh, nan thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah ih hnenah hna an ṭuan pei ih Puanthlam sungih an ṭuanvo hmuahhmuah cu an ṭuansuak thluh pei. Asinain hnaṭuan dingih a tlak lomi cu nan hnenah an tel lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl parih ka thinhengnak a thlen sal lonak dingah nangmah le na fapa pawl lawnglawng in Hmun Thianghlim le biakṭheng ih hnaṭuan ding pawl cu ṭuanvo lak in nan ṭuansuak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi pawl sung ihsin nan hrangih laksawngah nan sungkhat Levi mi pawl a lo hril saktu cu keimah ka si. Anmah tla cu Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan an ṭuansuak theinak dingah keimah ih hnenih hlanmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nangmah le na fapa pawl lawnglawng in biakṭheng le Hmun Thianghlim Bik sungih puithiam hnaṭuan pawl cu nan ṭuansuak pei. Puithiam hnaṭuan cu laksawngah ka lo pek zo hai ruangah nan ṭuanvo a si. Hi hnaṭuan ṭuan dingih a tlak lomi pawl cu thilri thianghlim kiangih an rat asile thah an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in Aaron hnenah, “Zohhnik, mei-ur thawinak pekmi siar lo a dang laksawng ka hnenih an pekmi hmuahhmuah cu nangmah ka lo pek a si. Hi laksawng pawl cu nangmah le na fapa pawl hrangah kumkhua ih nan co dingah ka lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakṭheng ih mei-ur thawinak ah ur lomi laksawng thianghlim cu a tanglam pawl hi an si: thlairawl thawinak, sualthlah thawinak, le mawhnak thawinak an si. Ka hnenih in pekmi, hi thawinak thianghlim pawl cu a zatein nangmah le na fapa pawl ih covo an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi thawinak thianghlim pawl cu hmun thianghlim ah na ei pei; mipa dang khal in an ei thei pei. Nan hrangah a thianghlimmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Cuih tlunah Israel mi pawl in a hleice ih an pekmi laksawng khal na ta an si ding. Nangmah le na fapa le na fanu pawl hrangah sanmureng tiang nan covo dingah ka lo pe a si. Nan innsang sungih mithiangfai pawl hmuahhmuah in an ei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in kumtin an neih hmaisa bik lakih a ṭha bik fang, sabit le olif siti pawl in pekmi cu nangmah ka lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zatein nangmah ih ta an si pei. Na innsang sungih mithiangfai pawl hmuahhmuah in an ei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in ka hnenah in pekmi hmuahhmuah cu na ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka hnenih an pekmi minung siseh, ṭilva siseh, fatir hmuahhmuah cu na ta an si ding. Asinain milai fatir siseh, ṭilva fatir raitluan lomi siseh, an tlen sal tikah a tlennak paisa cu na sang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naute cu a tlennak man an khiah bangtuk in ngun tangka fang nga in thla khat a ti-ah an tlen sal pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ṭilva fatir: caw le tuu le me pawl cu tlen sal ding an si lo. A pum in keimah ih ta an si ih thawinakah pek ding an si. An thisen cu biakṭheng kapah na theh pei ih an thau pawl cu thawinak pekmi rawlhun thawinak le rimthaw-ah meisa in na ur pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sa pawl, a ir le a vorhlam cawn cu a hleice ih pekmi na covo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl in ka hnenih an pekmi, ahleicemi laksawng pawl cu kumkhua in nangmah le na fapa le na fanu pawl hrangah ka lo pe a si. Himi cu siatbal thei lomi thukamnak nangmah le na tesinfa pawl hnenih ka tuahmi a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in Aaron hnenah, “Co theihmi rothil na la lo pei ih Israel ram sungah leiram comi khal na nei lo pei. Ziangahtile Bawipa keimah hi na ro le na covo ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi pawl in ka hnenih ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat an pekmi hmuahhmuah cu Levi mi pawl hnenah ka pek zo. Himi cu ka umnak Puanthlam an kilkhawi ih a sungih hna an ṭuan ruangah pekmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mi zohman in Puanthlam cu an naih lo pei. An naih asile an sual manah thih an tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Atu thokin Levi mi lawnglawng in Puanthlam cu an kilveng pei ih thil an tisual a si ahcun anmah in an tuar pei. Hi daan cu na tesinfa pawl khal in an thlun dingmi a si. Levi mi pawl in Israel mi lakah kumkhua ih comi rothil an nei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangahtile Israel mi pawl ih in pekmi ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat cu an co dingah ka pe zo a si. Cuti a si ruangah Israel ram sungah kumkhua ih comi rothil nan nei lo pei, tiah ka tinak a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi mi pawl hiti ih sim dingah thu a pek, “ Bawipa hnenih an pekmi ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat Israel mi hnen ihsin nan ngah tikah, cuih nan ngahmi sungin ṭhenhra ih ṭhenkhat cu a hleice ih pekmi laksawng a si ih Bawipa hnenah nan hlan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi laksawng cu lothlo pawl ih fang thar le sabit thar an pekmi tlukah ruat ding a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Israel mi hnen ihsin nan ngahmi ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat hmuahhmuah sung ihsin Bawipa hnenah ṭhen hra ṭhen khat nan pek pei. Nan ngahmi hmuahhmuah sung in Bawipa hnenih nan pek dingmi cu puithiam Aaron hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nan ngahmi sungih a ṭha bik miangmo nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutiih a ṭha bik nan pek hnuah cun a taangmi cu nan ta a si pei ih nan fang ciilnak le nan sabit rialnak ih suak vemi tlukah siar a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Puanthlam sung nan hnaṭuan hlawhman a si ruangah nanmah le nan innsang pawl in nan duhnaknak hmunah nan ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nan neihmi lakih a ṭha bikmi Bawipa nan pek ahcun nan ei tikah mawhthluknak nan tong lo ding. Cun Israel mi pawl ih pekmi laksawng thianghlim a ṭha bikmi Bawipa hnenih pek hlanah ei tahrat in borhhlawhter hlah uh; nan borhhlawhter asile nan thi ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a hnuailam ih daan pawl Israel mi hnenih pe dingah thu a pek: Raitluan mi le hna a ṭuan hrih lomi cawla sen rak keng hai sehla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />puithiam Eleazar hnenah pe hai seh. Riahhmun lengah an suahpi pei ih Eleazar hmaiah an that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Eleazar in a thisen hrekkhat cu a lak pei ih Puanthlam hmailam ahcun a mehtok in voisarih tiang a theh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sa zatein - a vun le a tit, a thisen le a sungril pawl thawn - puithiam hmuh hngan rori ahcun ur thluh a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule puithiam in sidar thing, hissop thingṭeek le puan sen a lak pei ih meisa sungah cun a paih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a hnipuan a sawp pei ih ti a bual ṭheh hnuah riahhmun ah a kir sal pei. Asinain cuih zanlam tiang cu mithiangfai lo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Caw a thattu pa khal in a hnipuan a sawp pei ih ti a bual pei. Asinain cuih zanlam tiang cu mithiangfai lo a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun a thianghlim pa pakhat in caw senih vutcam cu a lak pei ih riahhmun leng hmun thiangfai ah a ret pei. Cumi cu Israel mi pawl in thianfainak hrangih tidai an hman tikah cuih tidai thianfaiternak ah an hmang pei. Cumi cu sual thianfainak hrangih urmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih vutcam a latu cun a hnipuan a sawp pei. Asinain cuih zanlam tiang cu mithiangfai lo a si pei. Hi daan cu Israel mi siseh, an lakih ummi ramdangmi siseh, kumkhua in an thlun dingmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miruak a daitu cu ni sarih sung mithiangfai lo a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thianfaiternak tidai in ni thumnak ni le ni sarihnak ni ah a thiangfai awk lo ding ih cuticun mithiangfai ah a cang ding. Asinain ni thumnak ni le ni sarihnak ni ah a thiangfai awkter lo a si ahcun mi thiangfai lo a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miruak a daitu cu thianfainak tidai a toih-awk lo ahcun mithiangfai lo a si ringring. Bawipa ih Thukam retnak Puanthlam a borhhlawhter ruangah Bawipa ih minung lakah siarcih a si nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat a deuthlam sungih a thih ahcun a thih laiih a deuthlam sungih a ummi siseh, a leng ihsin a rung lutmi siseh, ni sarih sung cu mithiangfai lo an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sin a nei lomi palang le beel khal an thiangfai ve lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cubangtuk ṭhiamṭhiam in riahhmun lengah mi pakhatkhat hriamhma in siseh, mahte thih in siseh, a thi ih cuih ruak a thamtu cu ni sarih sung mithiangfai lo a si pei. Milai ruh siseh, milai thlaan siseh, a thamtu cu ni sarih sung mithiangfai lo a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bangtuk ih thianfai lonak a um tikah sual thianfainak dingih urmi caw senih vutcam an lak pei ih beel sungih an ret hnuah tidai fai an burh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmaisa-ah a thiangfaimi mi pakhat in hissop thing ṭeek pakhat la tahratin cuih tidai sungah a hnim pei ih deuthlam le a sungih ummi thilri hmuahhmuah le minung pawl a theh thluh pei. A neta-ah a thiangfaimi mi dang pakhat in tidai cu a lak pei ih miruh le miruak le thlaan a thamtu cu a theh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun a thiangfaimi mi pakhatkhat in ni thumnak ni le ni sarihnak ni ah cuih tidai cun mithiangfai lo cu a theh pei. Ni sarihnak ni ahcun cupa cu a thianfaiter ding ih a hnipuan a sawp hnuah ti a kholh-aw pei ih zanlam nitla ah mithiangfai a cang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat mithiangfai lo a si ih thianfainak tidai in a kholh-awk lo ahcun thianfai termi a si lo ruangah mithiangfai lo ringring a si. Cubangtuk mi cu Bawipa ih Puanthlam a borhhlawhter ruangah Pathian ih minung lakah siarcih ding a si nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi daan cu a kumkhua ih nan thlun dingmi a si. Cule thianfainak tidai a thehtu khal in a hnipuan a sawp thluh pei. Hi tidai a thamtu cu zanlam tiang mithiangfai lo a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziang khal mithiangfai loih tham mi pohpoh cu a thiangfai lo pei ih zokhal cumi a thamtu pohpoh cu zanlam tiang mithiangfai lo a si pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla hmaisabik ah Israel misenpi pawl cu Zin nelrawn an thleng ih Kadesh ah riahhmun an khuar. Cutawkah Miriam cu a thi ih an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule misenpi hrangah tidai a um lo ruangah Moses le Aaron hnenih phunzai dingin an tongkhawm aw ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hitiih si hnak cun kan unau Israel mi hrekkhat pawl thawn Bawipa ih Puanthlam hmaiah khan thi ve nungla a ṭha sawn ding naón!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangah so hi bangtuk ramṭhing ah hin in thlenpi? Hitawkih kan ṭilva pawl thawn thi dingah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zianghrangah so hivek ram ṭha lo, zianghman a khoh thei lonak ramih hruai dingah cun Izipt ram ihsin in suahpi? Hinah zianghman a um lo: fang le theipi, sabit le taleti tla a um lo! Tidai in ding rengreng hman a um lo!” tiah an phunzai ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah misenpi hmai ihsin Moses le Aaron cu an ṭhawn ih Puanthlam sangka hmaiah an ding. Cutawkah leilung ah an bok ih an hnenah Bawipa ih huham tleu cu a rung lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thukam Kuang hmaiih a ummi kianghrol kha la awla nangmah le na u Aaron in misenpi pawl cu kokhawm uh. Cutawkah misenpi hmuh hngan rori ahcun khitawk ih a ummi lungpi khi tidai suak dingin sim uhla tidai a suak ding. Cuticun khi lungpi sungin tidai na suakter ding ih misenpi siseh, an ṭilva pawl siseh, tidai an in ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cu Bawipa thupeknak bangtuk in a feh ih kianghrol cu a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in Israel misenpi pawl cu lungpi hmai ahcun an kokhawm ih Moses in, “Ngai uh, nannih raltho pawl! Nanmah ih hrangah a si lo maw hi lungpi ihsin tidai suahter rero a ṭul cu?” a ti ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses in a kianghrol cu a thlir ih lungpi cu voihnih a vuak. Cutikah tidai cu a puut zurzo ih misenpi le ṭilva pawl cun an in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa in Moses le Aaron cu, “Ka thianhlimnak huham nan zum kim lo ruangah Israel misenpi hmaiah tlamtling in in upat lo; curuangah hi misenpi pawl pek dingih ka tiammi ram ah nannih in nan hruai suak hai lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih hmun cu Israel mi pawl in Bawipa hnenih an phunzainak le Bawipa in a thianhlimnak huham a langternak a si ruangah Meribah tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses in Kadesh ihsin Edom siangpahrang hnenah palai a thlah. Cuih palai pawl in Edom siangpahrang hnenah, “Na unau Israel hrin pawl in thu an lo cah. Ziangtluk in harsatnak kan tong ti cu na thei thluh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan pu le kan pa pawl cu Izipt ramah an feh ih kum reipi an vung um. Izipt mi pawl in kan pupa le kanmah pawl in tisiat tuk ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah bomnak dil in kan au. Kan aunak in thei ih vancungmi pakhat a run thlah ih Izipt ram in in suahpi. Atu-ah cun na ramri kiangih Kadesh khua ah kan um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In zaangfah awla na ram sungin in fehter siang hram aw. Kanmah siseh, kan ṭilva pawl siseh, lamzin ihsin zinsak zinthlangah kan pial lo ding. Nan lo ah siseh, nan sabit hmuan khal ah siseh, kan lut lo ding. Cun nan tikhur pawl ih tidai khal kan in hrimhrim lo ding. Na ram sung ihsin kan liam hlan lo lamzinpi lawnglawng kan zawh ding, an ti a si,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain Edom mi pawl cun, “Kan ram cu a pal in nan pal hrimhrim lo pei. Nan pal a si ahcun kan ra suak pei ih kan lo do ding a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi pawl cun, “Lamzinpi lawnglawng kan zawh ko ding. Kanmah in siseh, kan ṭilva pawl in siseh, nan tidai kan in pang a si khalle a man kan kuan ko ding. Nan ram voikhat pal phahte lawng khi kan lo dilmi cu a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Edom mi pawl cun, “Kan ram nan pal thei lo,” an ti ih Israel mi pawl do dingah an ralkap tamzet, hriamnam ṭhazet thawn an pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutiin Edom mi pawl ih an ram pal an sian lo ruangah Israel mi pawl cu an kir ih lamzin dang an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Kadesh hmun ihsin an pok ih Edom ramri kiangih ummi Hor Tlang an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutawk ahcun Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Aaron cu Israel mi hnenih pek dingah ka tiammi ram a thleng lo ding. Ziangahtile nan pahnih in Meribah ah ka thupekmi nan thlun duh lo ih in dodal ruangah Aaron cu a thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa Eleazar cu Hor Tlang ah fehpi awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aaron ih puithiam thilthuam cu hlit awla Eleazar hrukter aw. Aaron cu khitawk ah a thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa ih a ti vek cun Moses in a tuah ṭheh. Misenpi hmuhah Hor Tlang cu an kai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses in Aaron ih puithiam thilthuam cu a hlit sak ih Eleazar a hrukter. Cule Aaron cu cutawk tlangpar ahcun a thi ih Moses le Eleazar cu an rung kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel misenpi in Aaron a thih an theih tikah an zatein ni sawmthum sung mithi ngai in an um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanaan ram thlanglam kapih a ummi Kanaan siangpahrang Arad in Israel mi pawl Atharim lam in an ra ti a theih tikah a rak do ih a hrekkhat cu a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi pawl in Bawipa ih hnenah, “Hi miphun pawl hi in nehter a si ahcun anmah siseh an khua pawl siseh, nangmah hnenah kan lo hlan thluh ding ih kan siatsuah thluh ding,” tiah siatcam in thu an kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cumi cu Bawipa in a thei ih Kanaan mi pawl cu a nehter. Curuangah Israel mi pawl in Kanaan mi pawl cu an that thluh ih an khua pawl khal an siatsuah thluh. Cuih hmun cu Hormah tiah an ko tata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Hor Tlang ihsin an feh ih Edom ram heel in Tipi Sen lamin an feh. Asinain lamlakah an thin a ṭeu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa le Moses an thangsiat. “Hitawk hmun, tidai le rawl um lonak ih thi dingah hin ziangah so Izipt ram ihsin in suahpi? Hi rawl siava pawl cun in ning tuk zo a si!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in micuk hrang tur neimi rul pawl an lakah a suahter ih Israel mi tampi an cuk ih an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misenpi cu Moses hnenah an ra ih, “ Bawipa le nangmah kan lo dodal hi kan sual a si. Hi rul pawl hi cemter dingin Bawipaói hnenah in dilsak hram aw,” tiah an ti. Cutikah Moses in misenpi hrangah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Rul tuah awla ṭhuam parah thlai aw. Rul ih a cukmi hmuahhmuah in cumi an zoh asile an nung ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ti bangtuk cun Moses in daar rul cu a tuah ih ṭhuam parah a thlai. Rul cukmi pawl cuih daar rul zohtu hmuahhmuah in an nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an feh sal ih Oboth ah riahhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Oboth ihsin an feh sal lala ih Moab ram ihsin nisuahnak lam nelrawnih a ummi Iye-Abarim ah riahhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin an pok sal ih Zered Phairawn ah riahhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zered Phairawn ihsin an feh sal lala ih Amor ramri tiang a kaumi nelrawn ah an thleng ih Arnon tiva saklam ah riahhmun an khuar. Arnon cu Moab mi le Amor mi pawl ih ramri a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa Raldonak Cabu sungih: “Sufah pengah Waheb khua le a phairawn, Arnon Tiva le phairawn pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />horkuam lo tlang pawl in Ar khua tiang, Moab ramri tiangin,” tiih a umnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutawk in an feh ih Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Miseenpi pawl cu kokhawm awla tidai ka pek hai ding,” a tinak Tikhur timi hmun ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih caanah cun Israel mi pawl in a tanglam hla hi an sak: “Maw tikhur, na tidai suah awla, Hla in kan lawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi tikhur cu lal pawl le, Mi hotu pawl ih laihmi a si. Lal pawl in an fung an hmangih, Hotu pawl in an kianghrol an hmang a si,” tiin an sak. Cuih phairawn ihsin Mattanah ah an ṭhawn ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cutawk ihsin Nahaliel ah, Nahaliel ihsin Bamoth ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cule Bamoth ihsin Moab ram phairawn Pisgah Tlang zik hnuai nelrawn vun hmuh theinak ah an ṭhawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cun Amor siangpahrang Sihon hnenah palai an thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Na ram sungin in fehter hram aw. Kanmah siseh, kan ṭilva siseh, lamzinpi in kan pial lo ding. Na lo ah siseh, na sabit hmuan ah siseh, kan lut lo ding. Na tikhur ih tidai khal kan in lo ding. Na ram kan lan lai hlan lo lamzinpi lawnglawng in kan feh ding,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Sihon in Israel mi pawl ih a ram an pal ding cu a siang lo. A ralkap pawl a kokhawm ih Jahaz phairawn ah an feh ih Israel mi pawl cu an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain an do awknak ah Israel mi pawl cun tampi an that ih an ram cu Arnon Tiva in saklam ih Jabbok tiang, cuti cun Ammon ramri tiang, an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutiin Israel mi pawl in Amor mi ih khawpi pawl, Heshbon le a kiangih khua pawl tla an lak ih an luah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon cu Amor siangpahrang Sihon umnak khawpi a si. Sihon cu a hlanih Moab siangpahrang a rak nehtu le a ram hmuahhmuah Arnon Tiva tiang a rak long ṭhehtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah hla phuahtu pawl in: “Heshbon ah ra uh, Sihon khawpi ah, Din salmi khawpi ah cang seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi Heshbon khawpi in an rak suak, Meisa bangin Sihon ralkap pawl cu, Moab mi khawpi Ar an siatsuah, An ur ṭheh Arnon hmunsang pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Riahsiatza nan si, Moab mi pawl, Nan cem a si, Khemosh betu pawl. Nan khawzing in a faale pawl cu raltlan ah a lo canter ih, Nunau pawl cu Amor siangpahrang sal ah a lo canter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Atu-ah an tefa pawl cu siatsuah thluh an si, Heshbon in Dibon thleng tiang, Nashim in Medeba kiang Nofah khua tiang,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuticun Israel mi pawl in Amor mi pawl ih ram cu an luah ih an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule Moses in Jazer khawpi donak lamzin zohtu dingah mi a thlah. Israel mi pawl cun Jazer khawpi le a kiangkapih khua pawl cu an neh ih cutawkih a ummi Amor mi pawl cu an dawihlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu an kir ih Bashan lamah an feh. Cutikah Bashan siangpahrang Og cu Israel do dingah a ralkap thawn Edrei ah ṭanhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Hi siangpahrang cu ṭih hlah. Amah le a minung pawl le a ram tlunah nehnak ka lo pe ding. Heshbon bawi, Amor miphun siangpahrang Sihon hnenih na tuah vekin hi Bashan siangpahrang Og tlun khalah na tuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ti vek cun Israel mi pawl in Og le a fapa pawl le a ramsung minung, pakhat hman taang loin an that ṭheh ih an ram cu an luah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an feh sal ih Jerikho khua ih khatlam ral, Jordan tiva ihsin nisuahnak lam, Moab hmunrawn ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl in Amor mi tlunih thil an tuahmi pawl kha Moab ram siangpahrang Zippor ih fapa siangpahrang Balak in a hmu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an tamzet fawn ruangah amah in siseh, a minung pawl in siseh, an ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Moab mi pawl in Midian mi hotu pawl hnenah, “Cawcang ih hrampi a piat thluh ṭheu vekin hi mi burpi in kan kiangkap cu an ciil siat thluh ding a si ko,” tiah an ti. Cule Siangpahrang Balak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaw ram, Eufrates Tivapi kiang Pethor khua ih a ummi Beor fapa Balaam hnenah palai a thlah. Cuih palai pawl hnen ihsin Balak in thu a cah ih, “Miphun phun khat pumpi Izipt ram in an suak ih atu-ah hin an minung pawl cu khuazakipah an darh-aw ih kan ram luah ṭheh an tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An minung zat ṭuat tikah in hleih tuk fawn. Curuangah i zaangfah hram awla hi mi pawl hi in ra camsiat sakta aw. Cuticun kan neh ding ih kan ram in kan dawi suak thei ding. Nangmah ih na thluasuahmi cu thluasuah an ngah ih na camsiatmi cu camsiat an si, ti ka thei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Moab hotu pawl le Midian hotu pawl cu camsiat man phalh ding keng in an pok ih Balaam hnen an thleng ih Balak ih thucah mi cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Balaam cun an hnenah, “Tuihzan cu hinah riak uhla thaisun ah Bawipa ih i simmi poh cu ka lo theihter hai ding,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Moab mi hotu pawl cu Balaam hnenah cun an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa in Balaam hnen ahcun, “Na hnenih a riakmi pawl hi zoso an si?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Balaam in, “Moab siangpahrang Balak ih palai pawl an si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin a ra suakmi miphun phun khat an ram ah an khat thluh a si ruangah cumi pawl do tahratih a dawi suaknak dingin camsiat dingah in ra fial a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in Balaam hnenah, “An hnenah tel ding na si lo; Israel mi pawl tla na cam lo pei; ziangahtile ka thlawsuah mi an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thaizing ah Balak palai pawl hnenah Balaam cu a feh ih, “Va kir uh; nan hnenih feh ve ding cu Bawipa in i kham a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Balak hnenah cun an kir ih an hnenih Balaam a tel duh lonak thu cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Balak in hotu thupi deuhdeuh le tam deuh a hei thlah sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An va feh ih Balaam hnen ahcun, “Zaangfahnak in ka hnenih rat ding cu zianghman in lo kham hram hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Laksawng tam ngaingai ka lo pe ding ih na simmi hmuahhmuah ka tuah thluh ding. Ra hramhram awla himi pawl hi ka aiah in camsiat sak aw,” tiah Balak ih thucahmi cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Balaam cun, “Balak in a siangpahrang inn sungih a ummi sui le ngun hmuahhmuah i pe hmansehla Bawipa ih thu cu ka el thei lo; thil fate thu hmanah Bawipa ka Pathian ih thupekmi cu ka el thei hrimhrim lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain midang bangin tuih zan cu hinah riak uhla Bawipa in thudang sim ding i neih asile tuihzan ah ka thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih zanah Pathian cu Balaam hnenah a ra ih, “Himi pawl in an hnenih feh ding an ra lo sawm a si ahcun feh dingah na tim tuah aw. Asinain ka lo simmi lawnglawng tuah aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuhrangah a thaizing cu Balaam in a laak cu a kung a tuah ih Moab hotu pawl hnen ahcun a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Balaam a feh ruangah Pathian cu a thin a heng. Balaam cu a hnen-um pahnih in an thlun ih a laak to in a feh laiah a lamzin kham dingah Bawipa ih vancungmi pakhat a hmaiah a rak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Balaam ih laak in ralnam a kengtu vancungmi pakhat lamzinih a din kha a hmuh tikah lamzin ihsin a pial ih hram lakah a feh. Balaam in a laak cu a vuak ih lamzin ah a kirter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cu lamzin cepthernak, sabit hmuan pahnih karlak, lungtlap pipi a zin kap hnih ih son awknak hmun ah a rak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A laak in vancungmi a hmuh tikah a khir ih Balaam ih ke cu lungtlap ah a rialcih. Cutikah Balaam in a laak cu a vuak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vancungmi cu hmaiah a rak feh lala ih pial-awk thei lonak lamzin ceprep ah a rak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vancungmi a hmuh tikah a laak cu a bok. Balaam in a thin a suup thei nawn lo ih a laak cu a fungin a vuak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in laak cu a ṭongter ih Balaam hnenah, “Ziang ka lo ti ruangah so voi thum tiangtiang i vuak?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Balaam in a laak hnen ahcun, “Lehnak menih i hman ruangah a si. Ralnam keng ningna cu atu rori-ah ka lo saat that ding naón,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah laak cun, “Na nun sung tutiang in na to ringringmi laak thotho ka si lo maw? Atu bangtuk in a hlanah ka lo ti dah maw?” a ti. “I ti dah lo,” tiah Balaam in a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Balaam ih mit cu a vangter ih vancungmi pakhat a ralnam thawn a din kha a hmuhter. Cutikah Balaam cu leilung ah a bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cun, “Ziangah so hi bangtuk in na laak cu voi thum tiang na vuak? Hi lam feh ding na si lo naón na feh ruangah na lamzin ka lo kham a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na laak in i hmu ih voi thum tiang a pial a si. Cutiin pial hlah sehla na laak cu ka zuah ding ih nang sawn hi ka lo that zo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutikah Balaam in, “Ka sual a si. Ka lamzin i kham ih lamzinih na din kha ka theih lo ruangah a si. Hi lam ka feh vivo hi na lung a kim lo a si ahcun inn ah ka kir ding,” tiah vancungmi hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Asinain vancungmi in, “Himi pawl hnenah feh ko aw; asinain sim ding ka lo timi lawng na sim pei,” a ti. Curuangah Balaam cu a ra kotu pawl hnenah a feh sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Balak in Balaam a ra ti a theih tikah a feh ih Moab ramri Arnon Tiva kapih Ar khua in a va hmuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutikah Balak in Balaam hnenah, “Ka lo sawm rero naón ziangah so na rat lo? Laksawng ṭhahnem i pe thei lo ding tiih na ruah ruangah maw si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cutikah Balaam in, “Atu cu ka ra thleng zo a sihi! Asinain ziang poh sim theinak ka nei lo. Pathian ih i simtermi lawnglawng ka sim ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cuticun Balaam cu Balak thawn Kiriath Huzoth khua ah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Balak in caw le tuu that in thawinak a tuah ih a sa hrekkhat cu Balaam le amah thawn a ummi hotu pawl a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thaizing ah Balak in Balaam cu Bamoth Baal tlang ah a fehpi. Cutawk ihsin Balaam in Israel mi burpi umnak hmuahhmuah cu a hmu thei a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Balaam in Balak hnenah, “Hitawk ah ka hrangah biakṭheng pasarih in dawl awla cawcang pasarih le tuucang pasarih i rak ken aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sim vekin a tuah ih Balak le Balaam in biakṭheng pakhat ah cawcang pakhat le tuucang pakhat fingfing biakṭheng pasarih ah thawinak an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Balaam in Balak hnenah, “Na mei-ur thawinak kiangah hin rak ding hrih awla kei cu Bawipa in i tong duh maw tong duh lo ka va hliahta hrih pei. Bawipa in ka hnenih a langtermi hmuahhmuah cu ka lo sim ding,” tiah a ti. Cule Balaam cu tlang parah a feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in Balaam cu a tong. Balaam in, “Biakṭheng pasarih ka dawl zo ih pakhat parah cawcang pakhat le tuucang pakhat fingfing ka thawi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Balak hnenah kir awla ka thucahmi va sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Balaam cu a kir ih Balak cu a mei-ur thawinak kiangah Moab mi hotu pawl thawn a rak din hrih kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Balaam in a tanglam vekin profet ṭongkam in a ṭong: “Moab siangpahrang Balak in i ko, Aram le nisuahnak lam tlang ihsin, ‘Ka aiah ra sim aw,’ i ti, ‘Israel mi pawl camsiat aw,’ i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ih camsiat lomi ziangtinso ka camsiat thei ding? Pathian ih camriam lomi ziangtinso ka camriam thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungpi tlangsaang in anmah cu ka cuan, Tlangzik par ihsin anmah ka hmu. Anmahte a nungmi miphun an si, Miphun dang lakah a siarcih awmi an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob ih tefa pawl cu vunnel zat an si, Israel cithlah pawl cu siar cawk an si lo. Pathian ih minung bangin ka nunnak ni cu liamseh, Miding bangin daihnak in thi ning law,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Balak in Balaam hnenah, “Ka parih na thil tuahmi hi ziangvek so a si? Ka ral pawl camsiat dingah hinah ka lo ko. Asinain anmah riangri thlawsuah na pek,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Balaam in, “Keiih ka simmi cu Bawipa in sim dingih i fialmi lawng a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Balak in Balaam hnenah cun, “Ra awla Israel mi hrekkhat lawng na hmuh theinak hmunah kan feh pei. Cutawk ihsin ka aiah camsiat hai aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Balak in Balaam cu Pisgah Tlang zik, Zofim ih lo ah a fehpi. Cutawk ahcun biakṭheng pasarih a dawl ih biakṭheng pakhat parah cawcang pakhat le tuucang pakhat fingfing thawinakah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Balaam in Balak hnenah, “Hitawk na mei-ur thawinak kiangah rak ding awla khitawk ah Pathian ka va tong ta pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in Balaam cu a tong ih a ṭong dingmi pawl cu a sim ih Balak sim dingah a kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Balaam cu a kir ih Balak a mei-ur thawinak kiangah Moab mi hotu pawl thawn a din hrih kha a hmu. Cutikah Balak in, “ Bawipa in ziang a ti so?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Balaam cun a thok ih profet ṭongkam in hiti in a ti: “Ra aw, Zippor fapa Balak, ra aw, Ka sim dingmi hi ra ngai hnik aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian cu thuphan per hmang milai vek a si lo, A thinlung a thleng leuhleuhmi milai vek khal a si lo. A tiamkammi hmuahhmuah cu a tuah suak, A ṭong ih tuah thluh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlawsuah pek ding lawng hi in fialmi a si, Pathian in thlawsuahnak a pek zo ih ka khir sal thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hmailamih an fehnak dingah, Vanduainak le harsat tonnak ding ka hmu lo. Bawipa an Pathian cu an hnenah a um ih, Pathian cu an Siangpahrang ah an aupi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in Izipt ram ihsin a suahpi hai ih, An hrangah cawcang hraang bangin a ṭang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dawi siseh polsia siseh a um lo, Israel miphun dodal ding ahcun. Miphun pawl in Israel an hmuh tikah, ‘Zohhnik uh, Pathian thiltuah hi,’ an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel miphun cu a cakzetmi kiosa vek a si, A deh ciami sa a bauh thluh le a ei thluh hlan lo, A thisen a in thluh hlan lo cu colh ti a nei lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Balak in Balaam hnenah, “Israel mi pawl camsiat ding cu na el thla rori a sihi! Sikhalsehla thlawsuahnak tal cu pe loin um aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain Balaam cun, “ Bawipa ih i fialmi lawnglawng ka tuah ding, tiah ka lo sim cia zo lo maw?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Balak in Balaam hnenah, “Ka hnenah ra awla hmun dangah ka lo fehpi ding. Cutawk ihsin cun ka ai-ih Israel mi pawl camsiat dingah Bawipa in a lo siang khal a si thei men,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Balak in Balaam cu nelrawn hmuh theinak Peor Tlang zik ah a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Balaam in Balak hnenah, “Ka hrangah biakṭheng pasarih hitawk ah dawl awla cawcang pasarih le tuucang pasarih i rak ken aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tivek cun Balak in a tuah ih biakṭheng pakhat parah cawcang pakhat le tuucang pakhat fingfing thawinakah a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi pawl thluasuah pe dingah i duh ti kha Balaam in a thei zo ih curuangah a hlan bangtuk in aizingnak tla tuah dingah a feh nawn lo. Nelrawn lamah cun a hoi kir ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi pawl a hrin a hrin ciarih an riah kha a hmu. Pathian ih thlarau cu a hnenah a rung thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />profet ṭongkam in hiti in a phuang: “Beor fapa Balaam ih thuphuanmi, Fiangte ih a hmu theitu pa-ih ṭongkam cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian simmi a theitu pa-ih thucah mi cu. Ka mit meng tahrat in ka hmu, Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih langnak cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih puanthlam cu an mawi a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tluantluan ih ciin mi ungkung bangin, Tiva kiangih hmuan pawl an bang, Bawipa ih ciinmi khukthli vek, Tidai kiangih sidar thing vek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanruah cat loin an ngah ding, Tidai a ciapmi lo sungah thlaici an tuh ding. An siangpahrang cu Agag hnakin a nasa deuh, A ukmi ram cu a kau ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in Izipt ram ihsin a suahpi, An hrangah cawcang hraang bangin a ṭang; An ral pawl cu an dolh thluh, An ruh an rialdip ih an thal pawl an khiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel cu a cak zetmi kiosa bangtuk a si, A ihthat lai ahcun zohman in an ṭhang ngam lo. Israel a thluasuahtu cu thlawsuah an si ve ding, Israel a camsiattu cu camsiat an si ve ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Balak cu a thin hengin a kut a tum ih Balaam hnenah, “Ka ral pawl camsiat dingah ka lo ko; asinain voi thum rori thlawsuah na pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu zamrangin na inn ah kir aw. Laksawng pe dingah ka lo tiam naón Bawipa in laksawng ngah ding cu a lo kham a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Balaam in, “Ka hnenih palai na rak thlahmi pawl hnenih ka sim zo vekin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na siangpahrang inn sungih a ummi sui le ngun a zatein i pek hmanah Bawipa ih thupekmi el tahrat in, a ṭha a sikhal le a sia a si khalle, keimah ih thu cun ka nung thei lo. Bawipa in sim dingih i fialmi lawnglawng ka sim ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Balaam in Balak hnenah, “Atu cu ka minung pawl hnenah ka kir thlang ding. Asinain ka feh hlanah hmailam caanah Israel mi pawl in na minung pawl parih an tuah dingmi hi ralrinnak ka lo sim cia duh a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule a thokih profet ṭongkam in hiti in a ṭong: “Beor fapa Balaam ih thuphuanmi, Fiangte ih a hmu theitu pa-ih ṭongkam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian simmi a theitu le, A Sang Bik ih a ummi hnen ihsin fimnak a cotu in, Ka mit meng tahrat in ka hmu; Ziangkimtithei Pathian ih langnak cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmailam tikcu caan sung khi ka hei zoh ih, Israel miphun ka hei hmu a si. Cuih miphun sung ihsin, Arsi bangtuk ih a tleumi Siangpahrang a suak ding. Deirel arsi bangin Israel miphun sungin a suak ding. Moab hotu pawl cu a vuak hai ding ih, Seth mi pawl cu a vuakthlak hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Edom ramih a ral pawl cu a neh ding ih, An ram cu amah ih ta-ah a cang ding. Israel cu nehtu a si ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel cun a ke thuaiah a pal hai ding ih, A luatmi lakih neta bik tiangin a that ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Balaam in langnak a hmuhmi ah Amalek mi pawl a hmu ih hiti in a phuang: “Amalek cu miphun lakah a cak bikmi a si, Asinain neta bikah cun kumkhua in a hloralta ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun langnak a hmuhmi ahcun Ken mi pawl a hmu ih Balaam in hiti in a ṭong lala, “Atu na umnak hmun cu a himzet a si, Khaam saangpi lungpi parih vate bu vek a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain nannih Ken mi pawl cu nan cem ding, Nan ral Assiria in a lo kaih tikah cun,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Balaam in hiti in a ṭong: “Saklam ih a tongkhawm mi pawl hi zoso an si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saipras ihsin mi dotu pawl tangphawlawng in an ra ding. Assiria le Eber an neh ding; Asinain annih khal kumkhua-in an hloralta ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Balaam cu a tho ih a khua ah a tlung; Balak khal a tlung ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Shittim ih an um laiah an mipa pawl in Moab nunau pawl cu an sualpi ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi Moab nunau pawl cun an khawzing an biaknak le an raithawinak puai ah Israel mi pawl cu an sawm. Israel mi pawl in rawl an ei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peor ih khawzing Baal cu an biak ve. Curuangah Bawipa cu an parah a thin a heng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses hnenah, “Israel mi hotu pawl kokhawm awla senpi hmuhah cupawl cu that hai aw. Cuticun Israel mi parah ka thin a dai ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Israel hotu pawl hnenah, “Nan hrin sungin Peor ih Baal khawzing a betu cu nan that ciar pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses le Israel misenpi pawl cu an riahsia in Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sangka ah an ṭap. Culai fangah an zate mithmuh ah Israel mipa pakhat in Midian nunau pakhat cu a deuthlam sungah a luhpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cumi cu Eleazar fapa, Aaron ih fapa sin, Finehas in a hmuh tikah a tho ih misenpi lakin a suak. Feipi a keng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cuih mipa le nunau nu cu a fuuk ih an deuthlam sungah cun an pahnih in a sun that. Curuangah Israel pawl parih a thlengmi natsia cu a reh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi thawng kul hluanli natsia in an rak thi zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Finehas in Israel mi parih ka thinhengnak cu a daiter zo a si. Anih cu keimah siar lo pathian ziangvek hman biak ding a duh hrimhrim lo. Curuangah Israel mi pawl ka siatsuah thluh lonak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Finehas cu sim awla kumkhuadaih in amah thawn thukamnak ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah dodaltu ziangvek khawzing hman a pom thei lo ih, Israel misenpi ih sual ngaithiamnak khal a suahter ruangah amah le a tesinfa pawl cu kumkhua-in puithiam an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mipa, Midian nunau nu thawn, thahnak a tuartu cu Salu fapa Zimri a si. Amah cu Simeon cithlah sungah hrin pakhat ih lu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunau an thahmi ih hmin cu Kozbi a si ih a pa Zur cu Midian hnam lakah hrin khatih lal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian mi pawl cu do awla siatsuah thluh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ziangahtile Peor ah nanmah an lo bum ih thil ṭha lo an tuah ruangah le Peor-ih natsia a thlen laiih thihnak a tuartu Kozbi ruangah siatsuah thluh ding an tlak a si,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Natsia a reh hnuah Bawipa in Moses le Aaron fapa Eleazar hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel misenpi, kum kul le a tlunlam, ralkap a ṭuan thei dingmi hmuahhmuah innsang pakhat hnu pakhat in mipum siarnak nan tuah pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi cu Moses le Eleazar in an thlun ih kum kul le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah hmun khatah an kokhawm. Jerikho kiang, Jordan Tiva ralih Moab hmunrawn ah an tongkhawm aw. Izipt ram ihsin a suakmi Israel mi pawl cu a hnuailam bangtuk an si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Reuben phunhnam ihsin (Reuben cu Jakob fapa upabik a si): Hanok, Pallu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hezron le Karmi hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sungah minung thawng sawmli thawng thum zasarih le sawmthum an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pallu ih tesinfa pawl cu Eliab le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a fapa Nemuel, Dathan, le Abiram an si. Hi Dathan le Abiram cu misenpi ih hrilmi kha an si. Moses le Aaron ih thu an el ih Bawipa an dodal tikah Korah dungthluntu pawl hnenah an tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An dinnak ih leilung a kak ih a dolh thluh hai. Cule meisa in minung zahnih le sawmnga a ur that tikah Korah le a dungthluntu pawl hnenah an thi a si. Misenpi hrangah ralrinternak ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain Korah ih fapa pawl cu an thi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Simeon hnam ihsin Nemuel, Jamin, Jakhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerah le Shaul hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sungin minung thawng kul hluanhnih le zahnih an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad hnam ihsin Zefon, Haggi, Shuni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ozni, Eri,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Arod le Areli hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sungin minung thawng sawmli le zanga an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah hnam ihsin (Judah fapa lakin pahnih, Er le Onan, cu Kanaan ramah an thi zo):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shelah, Perez, Zerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezron le Hamul hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sungin minung thawng sawmsarih thawngruk le zanga an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Issakhar hnam ihsin Tola, Puah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jashub le Shimron hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sung ihsin minung thawng sawmruk thawng li le zathum an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zebulun hnam ihsin Sered, Elon, le Jahleel hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sung ihsin minung thawng sawmruk le zanga an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Josef hnam pawl ihsin fapa pahnih Manasseh le Efraim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh hnam ihsin Manasseh fapa Makhir cu Gilead ih pa a si ih a tanglam hrin pawl cu Gilead ih cithlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Iezer, Helek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asriel, Shekhem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shemida, le Hefer hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hefer fapa Zelofehad cu fapa a nei lo; fanu lawng a nei ih an hmin cu Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah, le Tirzah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sung ihsin minung thawng sawmnga thawnghnih le zasarih an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Efraim hnam ihsin Shuthelah, Bekher, le Tahan hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Eran hrin cu Shuthelah cithlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl sung ihsin minung thawng sawmthum thawnghnih le zanga an kim. Hi pawl cu Josef ih tesinfa, an hrin ciar ih cithlah mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Benjamin hnam ihsin: Bela, Ashbel, Ahiram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shefufam, le Hufam hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ard le Naaman hrin pawl cu Bela cithlah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hi pawl cu Benjamin tesinfa sungin an hrin ciar ih cithlah mi an si; minung thawng sawmli thawngnga le zaruk an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Dan hnam ihsin Shuham hrin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Dan ih tesinfa pawl cu minung thawng sawmruk thawngli le zali an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asher hnam ihsin Imnah, Ishvi, le Beriah hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Heber le Malkhiel hrin pawl cu Beriah cithlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asher in Serah timi fanu pakhat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi pawl cu Asher tesinfa an si ih an hrin sungin minung thawng sawmnga thawngthum le zali an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Naftali hnam ihsin Jahzeel, Guni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jezer, le Shillem hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hi pawl cu Naftali tesinfa pawl an si ih an hrin sungin minung thawng sawmli thawngnga le zali an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />An zatein Israel mi mipa hmuahhmuah cu thawng zaruk thawng khat zasarih le sawmthum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“An tam le an mal zoh in ram cu hi hrin pawl hi zem hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ram cu camcawhfung zuk in ṭhen awla ramṭhen tum deuh cu mi tam deuh hrin hnenah pe awla ramṭhen fate deuh cu mi mal deuh hrin hnenah pe aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Levi hnam ihsin Gershon, Kohath, le Merari hrin pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A dang Levi hrin pawl cu Libni, Hebron, Mahli, Mushi le Korah cithlahmi an si. Kohath cu Amram ih pa a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amram in Izipt ramih a suakmi Levi ih fanu Jokhebed a ṭhi. Cule Jokhebed in Amram cu fapa pahnih Aaron le Moses le an farnu Miriam a hrin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Aaron in fapa pali a nei ih Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Nadab le Abihu cu Bawipa hnenih a thianghlim lomi thawinak an pek ruangah an thi zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Levi mi pawl cu mipa thla khat le thla khat tlunlam an zatein thawng kul hluanthlum an si. Levi mi pawl cu Israel ram sungah ram covo pekmi an si ve lo ruangah Israel midang pawl thawn rawi loin a dang teih cazin lakmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hi hrin pawl hmuahhmuah cu Moses le Eleazar in Jerikho kiang, Jordan Tiva ral Moab hmunrawnih Israel mi pawl mipum siarnak an tuah tikah cazin an lakmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Moses le puithiam Aaron in Sinai Nelrawn ih cazin an rak lak laiih minung pawl cu pakhat hman an taang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Bawipa in an zatein hramlak ramthing ah an thi ṭheh ding, a ti bangtuk in Jefunneh fapa Kaleb le Nun fapa Joshua siar lo, an thi ṭheh ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef fapa Manasseh, Manasseh fapa Makhir, Makhir fapa Gilead, Gilead fapa Hefer, Hefer fapa Zelofehad a si. Zelofehad in fanu lawng a nei ih anmah tla cu Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah le Tirzah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih a fanu pawl cu Moses, puithiam Eleazar, hruaitu pawl le misenpi hmaiah Puanthlam sangka ahcun an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kan pa in hramlak ah in thihsan zo; fapa pakhat hman a nei lo. Bawipa a dodaltu Korah ih dungthluntu lakah anih cu a tel lo. Amah ih sual ruangah a thi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fapa neih lo ruangah zianghrangah so kan pa ih hmin cu a sungkhat lak ihsin a hlohral ta ding? Kan pa ih unau lakah kannih khal covo in pe ve uh,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah an thu cu Moses in Bawipa a ron.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in a hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zelofehad fanu pawl ih an dilmi cu a dik a si. An pa ih unau lakah annih khal covo pe ve aw. An pa ih ro cu anmah in co hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Israel mi pawl cu sim awla, mi pakhatkhat fapa nei loih a thih ahcun a ro cu a fanu in a co pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fanu a neih lo asile a unau in an co pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unau khal a neih lo a si ahcun a pa ih unau in an co pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pa khal unau a neih lo a si ahcun a sungkhat lakih a nai bik in a co pei ih, amah ih ta ah a cang ta pei. Himi cu Bawipa keimah ih thupekmi a si ih Israel mi pawl in an thlun dingmi daan a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Abarim Tlangah hung feh awla Israel mi pawl hnenih ka pek dingmi ram cu va thlir aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thlir ṭheh cun na u Aaron a nunnak a cem bangtuk in nang khal a cem ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangahtile Zin hramlakih ka thupekmi nan pahnih in nan el ruangah a si. Meribah ah Israel misenpi in in dodal tikah keimah ih thianhlimnak huham cu nan dinpi duh lo a si,” a ti. Meribah cu Zin hramlak Kadesh ih cirhti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa nunnak hmuahhmuahih hramṭohnak Pathian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na minung pawl hi tuukhaltu nei lo tuurual bangtuk an si lonak dingah mi hruai theitu le raldo tikih mi ho theitu mi pakhat hril hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Thilti theinak a nei mi Nun ih fapa Joshua cu ko awla a lu parah na kut suang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam Eleazar le misenpi hmaiah cun dingter awla an zate ih hmaiah cun nangmah ih ai-awhtu a si, tinak thu than aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Israel misenpi in a thu an thlunnak dingah na thuneihnak hrekkhat cu amah pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua in puithiam Eleazar cu a rinsanzet pei ih Eleazar cun keimah ih duhnak thei dingah Urim le Thummim a hmang pei. Cuticun Joshua le Israel misenpi cu Eleazar in a ho pei ih amah ih thu in ziangtinkim ah an um pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk cun Moses in a tuah ṭheh. Puithiam Eleazar le misenpi hmaiah cun Joshua cu a dinter ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joshua-ih lu parah a kut a suang ih amah ai run awhtu dingah nemhngetnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in rimthawmi rawlhun thawinak pawl Bawipa ih hnenah a tikcu kim tikih an pek dingah sim dingin Bawipa in Moses hnenah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih rawlhun thawinak nan pek dingmi pawl cu hihi an si: nitin mei-ur thawinak hrangah raitluanmi kum khat ti tuucangte pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuucangte pakhat cu zinglamah, a dang pakhat cu zanlam ah, nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cumi thawinak thawn hmun khatah fanghun thawinak tla nan pek pei ih olif siti ṭha bik khuat khat thawn rawimi sangphut reeltan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih rimthaw thawinak pekmi a si ih Sinai Tlang parih hmaisa bik nan rak thawi bangtuk in hi thawinak cu nitinte meisa ur in thawinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cumi pakhatnak tuucangte pekmi thawn inmi thawinak khal nan pek pei ih sabit khuat khat biakṭheng ah nan toih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zinglam thawinak nan pekmi bangtuk in pahnihnak tuucangte cu zanlam ah nan pek pei ih inmi thawinak khal nan pek pei. Himi cu rawlhun thawinak a si ih Bawipa ih hrangah rimthaw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sabbath ni ah kum khat ti raitluan tuucangte pahnih, thlairawl thawinak hrangah olif siti thawn rawimi sangphut reel khat cu inmi thawinak thawn nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi mei-ur thawinak cu nitinte pekmi fanghun thawinak le inmi thawinak hlei ah Sabbath nitin pekmi thawinak a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlatin ni hmaisabik ah Bawipa ih hnenah a tanglam pawl cu nan pek pei: cawcangte pahnih, tuucang pakhat, kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih tlunah olif siti thawn rawimi thlairawl thawinak, cawcang pakhat ah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang pakhat ah sangphut reel khat thawn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat ah sangphut reel tan thawn nan pek pei. Hi mei-ur thawinak pawl cu rawlhun thawinak an si ih Bawipa ih hrangah rimthaw an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Felzet ih inmi thawinak pekmi a si ahcun cawcang pakhat ah sabit khuat hnih, tuucang pakhat ah khuat khat le a hrek, kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat ah khuat khat nan pek pei. Kum khat sung thlatin ni hmaisa bikih mei-ur thawinak pek tikah thlun ding daan an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun nitin mei-ur thawinakah sabitti an telh ih hlei ah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang pakhat pek a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih upat cawimawinak ih tuahmi Lantak Puai cu thla hmaisa bik ni hleili ni ah tuah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni hleinga ni ihsin biaknak puai a thok pei ih ni sarih sung a si pei. Cuih sung hmuahhmuah cu thilnu tel lo sang nan ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puai ni hmaisa bik ni ahcun ziang hnaṭuan hman nan ṭuan lo pei. Pathian biak dingah nan pumkhawm sawn pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak pek uhla cumi cu Bawipa hnenih pekmi rawlhun thawinak a si pei: cawcangte pahnih, tuucang pakhat, kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an zatein raitluan nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Fanghun thawinak feltein tuah uhla olif siti thawn rawi uh; cawcang pakhat ah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang pakhat ah reel khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuucangte pakhat ah reeltan a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih tlunah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang pakhat nan pek pei ih cuticun misenpi thianhlimnak hrangah mawhnak thawinak cu tuah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himi cu nitinte tuahmi mei-ur thawinak hlei ah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cubangtuk ṭhiamṭhiam in ni sarih sung Bawipa ih hnenah rawlhun thawinak, a hrangih rimthawmi cu nan pek pei. Himi cu nitinte nan pekmi mei-ur thawinak le inmi thawinak hlei ah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sarih ni ah a thianghlim mi pumkhawmnak nan nei pei ih zianghman nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nan Rawllak Puai ni hmaisa bik Bawipa hnenih fangthar nan pek tikah Pathian biak dingah nan pumkhawm pei ih zianghman hna nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa hrangah rimthaw, mei-ur thawinak nan pek pei ih, cawcang pahnih, tuucang pakhat, le kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cumi thawn olif siti rawimi, felteih tuahmi thlairawl thawinak nan pek pei ih cawcang pakhat ah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang pakhat ah reel khat le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat ah reel tan a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih tlunah sualthlah thawinakah mecang pakhat nan pek pei ih cuticun misenpi thianhlimnak hrangih sualthlah thiannak cu nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi thawinak pawl le inmi thawinak cu nitin nan tuahmi mei-ur thawinak le thlairawl thawinak hlei ah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarihnak ni hmaisa bik ni ah pumkhawmnak thianghlim nan nei pei ih hna zianghman nan ṭuan lo pei. Cuih ni ah tawtawrawt nan tum pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah rimthaw mei-ur thawinak nan pek pei: raitluan cawcangte pakhat, tuucang pakhat, le kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Olif siti thawn rawimi sangphut in thlairawl thawinak felzetin nan tuah pei. Cawcang hrangah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang hrangah reel khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat ah reel tan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih tlunah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang pakhat nan pek pei ih cuticun misenpi thianhlimnak hrangah sualthlah thiannak nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thawinak pawl cu thla thar ni hmaisa bikih mei-ur thawinak le thlairawl thawinak, nitin mei-ur thawinak le thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl ih hlei ah nan pek pei. Hi rawlhun thawinak pawl cu Bawipa ih hrangah rimthaw an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thla sarih thla, ni hra ni ah Pathian biak dingah nan pumkhawm pei. Rawl nan ei lo pei, hna khal nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah rimthawmi mei-ur thawinak pek uh: cawcangte pakhat, tuucang pakhat le kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Olif siti thawn rawimi sangphut in thlairawl thawinak felzetin nan pek pei: cawcang pakhat hrangah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang hrangah reel khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kum khat ti tuucangte hrangah reel tan a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule misenpi thianhlimnak hrangih sualthlah thiannak, nitin mei-ur thawinak, thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl ih hlei ah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang pakhat nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thla sarih, ni hleinga ni ah pumkhawmnak thianghlim nan nei pei. Bawipa sunloihnak ah hi puai cu ni sarih sung nan tuah pei ih hna zianghman nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi puai ni hmaisa bik ni ah Bawipa ih hnenah meisa thawn rawlhun thawinak rimthaw nan pek pei: cawcangno hlei thum, tuucang pahnih, le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili, an zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Olif siti thawn rawimi thlairawl thawinak cu feltein nan tuah pei: cawcang pakhat hrangah sangphut reel khat le a tan, tuucang pakhat hrangah reel khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kum khat ti tuucangte pakhat hrangah reel tan le inmi thawinak pawl nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih tlunah sualthlah thawinak hrangah mecang pakhat nan pek pei. Hi thawinak pawl cu nitin mei-ur thawinak le thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak hlei ih pekmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni hnihnak ni ah cawcangno hleihnih, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak tla cawcang hrang, tuucang hrang le tuucangte hrangah a zat an khiah cia vekin nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih tlunah nitin nan pekmi mei-ur thawinak, thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl cu sualthlah thawinak hrangih mecang pakhat nan pekmi thawn nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni thumnak ni ah cawcangno hleikhat, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak tla cawcang hrang, tuucang hrang le tuucangte hrangah a zat an khiah cia vekin nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih tlunah nitin nan pekmi mei-ur thawinak, thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl cu sualthlah thawinak hrangih mecang pakhat nan pekmi thawn nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni linak ni ah cawcangno pahra, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak tla cawcang hrang, tuucang hrang le tuucangte hrangah a zat an khiah cia vekin nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuih tlunah nitin nan pekmi mei-ur thawinak, thlairawl thawinak le inmi thawinak pawl cu sualthlah thawinak hrangih mecang pakhat nan pekmi thawn nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni nganak ni ah cawcangno pakua, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himi thawn hmun khatah ni khatnak ni ih nan pekmi thawinak dang pawl khal a zatein nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni ruknak ni ah cawcangno pariat, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himi thawn hmun khatah ni khatnak ni ih nan pekmi thawinak dang pawl khal a zatein nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ni sarihnak ni ah cawcangno pasarih, tuucang pahnih le kum khat ti tuucangte hleili nan pek pei. An zatein raitluan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Himi thawn hmun khatah ni khatnak ni ih nan pekmi thawinak dang pawl khal a zatein nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ni riatnak ni ah pumkhawm thianghlim nan tuah pei ih hna zianghman nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah mei-ur thawinakih pekmi thlairawl thawinak rimthawmi cu nan pek pei: cawcangno pakhat, tuucang pakhat le kum khat ti tuucangte pasarih, an zatein raitluan nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Himi thawn hmun khatah ni khatnak ni ih nan pekmi thawinak dang pawl khal a zatein nan pek cih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hi thawinak pawl hmuahhmuah cu a tikcu ciarah Bawipa hnenah nan pek pei. Mei-ur thawinak pawl, thlairawl thawinak pawl, inmi thawinak pawl le sualthlah thawinak pawl cu nan pek thluh pei. Hi pawl cu nan thukam kimternakih pumpak ciarih pekmi thawinak, a si lole mah lungtho teih pekmi thawinak pawl hlei ih nan pekmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuticun Bawipa ih thupekmi hmuahhmuah cu Moses in Israel misenpi hnenah a sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in a hnuailam ih daan pawl cu Israel mi hnam tinih hotu pawl hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in Bawipa ih hnenah thil pakhat pek dingin thu a kam-awk tikah siseh, a si lole thil pakhat tuah lo dingin thu a kam-awk tikah siseh, cuih a thukammi cu a bal sal lo pei. Ka ti ding a timi cu kimtein a tuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fala pakhat in a pa ih innih a um laiah Bawipa hnenih ziangmaw pek dingah thu a kam-aw, a si lole ziangmaw tuah lo dingin thu a kam-awk tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />cuih a thukammi cu a pa in a theih tikah lungkim lonak a neih dah ti lo ahcun a thukammi vekin a thlun thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain a thukammi cu a pa in a theih ih a kham a si ahcun a thlun a ṭul lo pei. A thukammi vekih tuah ding cu a pa in a kham ruangah Bawipa in a ngaithiam ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasal nei hrih lomi nunau pakhat in, tumtahnak nei fetfet in maw, a si lole tumtahnak mumal nei lem lo in maw, thil pakhatkhat tuah hrimhrim lo dingin thu a kam-awk hnuah pasal a nei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cumi cu a pasal in a theih tikah a lung a kim loih a kham dah tilo ahcun a thukammi vekin a thlun thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain a thukammi cu a pasal in a thei ih a kham a si ahcun a thlun a ṭul lo pei. Bawipa in a ngaithiam ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuhmei siseh, leengleh siseh, tuah dingih thu a kam awkmi, a si lole tuah lo dingih thu a kam awkmi cu a thlun thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasal a neimi nunau in thil pakhatkhat tuah lo dingih a kammi cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a pasal in a theih tikah a lung a kim loih a kham dah tilo ahcun a thukam vekin a thlun thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain a thukammi cu a pasal in a thei ih a kham a si ahcun a thlun a ṭul lo pei. A pasal in a kham a si ruangah Bawipa in a ngaithiam ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nunau pakhat in siatcam ih thu a kammi, a si lole thu a tiammi kha hngetter ding, a si lole phiatsak dingah a pasal in thu a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain a nupi ih thukammi a theih sunah lungkim lonak zianghman a langter lo ahcun a thukammi vekin a thlun a ṭul a si. A theih vete in a nupi cu a kham lo ruangah a lungkimpi ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun a nupi ih thukammi a theih hnupi-ah a bal sak a si ahcun a nupi ih mawhnak cu amah in a tuar pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi daan pawl cu Bawipa in Moses hnenah pasal neimi nunau in siseh, pasal nei hrih lo a pa ih innih um laimi fala in siseh, thukamnak an tuah tikih thlun dingah a pekmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl parih thil an tuahmi ruangah Midian mi pawl parah phu va hlam aw. Cumi na tuah ṭheh in leilung parih na nunnak cu a cem ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Israel mi pawl hnenah, “ Bawipa ih parih thil an tuahmi ruangah Midian mi pawl do ding le hrem dingin nan tim tuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel hnam khat in ralkap thawng khat ciar suah uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Israel hnam khat in minung thawng khat ciar an suak ih ral do dingah ralkap thawng hleihnih an tiar-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Moses in puithiam Eleazar ih fapa, thilri thianghlim pawl kilvengtu, Finehas cu an hotu dingah le raldo thupeknak tawtawrawt pawl kengtu dingah a tuah ih ralkap thawng hleihnih cu a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in Midian mi pawl cu an do ih mipa hmuahhmuah an thah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midian siangpahrang panga - Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, le Reba tla an thi. Midang tla tampi an that ih Beor fapa Balaam khal nam in an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Israel mi pawl cun Midian nunau le nauhak pawl cu an kai ih an caw le an tuu le an ṭilva dang hmuahhmuah le an sumsaw hmuahhmuah tla khal an long ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An khawpi pawl le an riahbuk pawl khal an ur ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An lonmi thilri hmuahhmuah le ṭilva pawl le ralkaihmi pawl cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerikho khua in Jordan Tiva khatlam ral, Moab hmunrawnih a ummi Moses, Eleazar le Israel misenpi pawl hnenah cun an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses, Eleazar, le Israel hotu dang pawl hmuahhmuah cu ralkap pawl hmuak dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Moses cu raldonak ihsin a ra kirmi ralbawi thawngkhat hotu le zakhat hotu pawl parah cun a thin a heng ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zianghrangah nunau hmuahhmuah khal nan that lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Balaam thu ngai tahratin Peor ah Israel misenpi pawl Bawipa ih hmaiah misual hlawhhlang bangtuk ih a cantertu cu hi nunau pawl hi an si, ti nan thei lo maw? Curuangah a si Bawipa ih minung pawl parih natsia a thlennak kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah mipa pohpoh cu nauhak tiangin that uhla mipa a pawl ciami nunau hmuahhmuah khal that ṭheh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain fala pawl le mipa a pawl hrih lomi nunau hmuahhmuah cu nanmah ih hrangah zuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule mi a thattu le miruak a thamtu hmuahhmuah cu ni sarih sung riahhmun lengah nan um ding. Ni thumnak ni le ni sarihnak ni ah nanmah pawl thianghlimter aw uhla nan kaihmi nunau pawl khal thianghlimter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hnipuan siseh, savun in tuahmi thil siseh, mehmul le zanthing in tuahmi thil siseh, pakhat hman hrelh loin nan thiangfaiter ṭheh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule puithiam Eleazar in raldonak ihsin a rami ralkap pawl hnenah, “ Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pekmi cu hi pawl hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meisa in a kangciam thei lomi sui, ngun, dar, thir, rangva, le suan pawl hmuahhmuah cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />meisa in nan huul pei ih cuticun nan thianfaiter pei. A dang hmuahhmuah cu thianfainak tidai in nan kholhfai thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni sarihnak ni ah nan hnipuan nan sawp thluh pei. Cuticun nan thiangfai pei ih riahhmun sungah luhter nan si pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nangmah le Eleazar le misenpi hotu pawl thawn an lonmi thilri, ṭilva, le an kaihmi minung cu siar thluh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule bangrep in ṭhen hnih ah ṭhen uh. Ṭhen khat cu ral a dotu pawl hrangah a si pei ih a dang ṭhen khat cu Israel misenpi hrangah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ralkap pawl ih co dingmi sungin ralkaihmi zanga ah pakhat cu Bawipa hrangih siah ah nan lak pei. Caw, laak, tuu, le me tla cuvek thotho in nan lak pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa ih ta dingah Eleazar hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule misenpi pawl ih co dingmi sungin ralkaihmi sawmnga ah pakhat cu siah ah la awla, caw, laak, tuu, le me khal cuvek thotho in na lak pei. Cule Bawipa ih Puanthlam kilvengtu Levi mi pawl hnenah na pek pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa ih tivek cun Moses le Eleazar in an tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tanglam pawl cu ralkap pawl in anmah hrangih an retmi hlei ih an lakmi le an kaihmi pawl an si: tuu thawng zaruk thawng sawmsarih le thawng nga, caw thawng sawmsarih le thawng hnih, laak thawng sawmruk le thawng khat, le falahim thawng sawmthum le thawng hnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi sungin a hrek ralkap pawl ih an co mi cu: tuu thawng zathum thawng sawmthum thawng sarih le zanga an si ih, Bawipa hnenih pekmi siah ah zaruk sawm sarih le panga; caw thawng sawmthum le thawng ruk a si ih, Bawipa hnenih pekmi siah ah sawm sarih le pahnih an pe; laak thawng sawmthum le zanga a si ih, Bawipa hnenih pekmi siah ah sawmruk le pakhat an pe; cule falahim thawng hleiruk an si ih Bawipa hnenih pekmi siah ah sawmthum le pahnih an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk in Bawipa ih siah cu Moses in Eleazar hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cun Israel misenpi ih covo cu: tuu thawng zathum thawng sawmthum le thawng sarih le zanga, caw thawng sawmthum le thawngruk, laak thawng sawmthum le zanga, le falahim thawnghleiruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi sungin Bawipa ih thupeknak bangtuk in minung siseh, ṭilva siseh, sawmnga ah pakhat cu Moses in a lak ih Bawipa ih Puanthlam kilvengtu Levi mi pawl hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi pawl cu Moses hnenah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Moses hnenah cun, “Bawipa, kan homi kan ralkap pawl cu kan siar thluh ih an kim ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Curuangah kan lak ciarmi sui hlawnthil, baannaal pawl, faute pawl, zunghruk pawl, hnakhai pawl, le ṭhi pawl kan rak keng a si. In tlennak dingah hi hlawnthil pawl hi Bawipa ih hnenah kan nunnak aiah kan pek a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cutikah Moses le Eleazar in an rak kenmi sui hlawnthil pawl cu an rak sang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ralbawi pawl ih pekmi sui hlawnthil cu azate in cuai za le cuai hra leng lo a rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ralbawi a si lomi pawl cun an lak mi hlawnthil cu anmah ih hrang ciarah an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Moses le Eleazar in Bawipa ih Israel mi pawl a humnak dingah sui hlawnthil pawl cu Puanthlam sungah an ret.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Reuben le Gad hrin pawl cu ṭilva tampi an nei. An ṭilva hrangah Jazer le Gilead ram pawl cu ramṭha an si kha an hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses le puithiam Eleazar le Israel hruaitu pawl hnenah an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hi ram sung um Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sebam, Nebo, le Beon khua pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa bomnak ih Israel mi pawl in kan luahmi khua pawl hi ṭilva hrangah ram ṭhazet an si. Kannih le ṭilva tamzet nei kan si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah in zaangfah uhla hi ram hi kan co dingah in zem hram uh. Jordan Tiva khatlam ralih um dingah Jordan Tiva cu in tanter hram hlah uh,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Gad le Reuben hrin pawl hnenah cun, “Nan unau Israel mi pawl raldo dingih an feh laiah nannih pawl hitawk ah maw a um nan tum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih a pekmi ram sungih lut lo le Jordan Tiva tan lo dingin ziangtinso Israel mi pawl cu an thin nan nauter ngam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atuih nan tuahmi vekin nan pa le pawl in hi ram thlingthla dingih Kadesh Barnea in ka thlah hai tikah an rak tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih in Eshkol Phairawn tiang an feh ih ram cu an ra zoh. Asinain an kir tikah Bawipa ih a pekmi ramih feh tum loin Israel mi pawl ih thinlung cu an derdaiter thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu cuih ni ah a thin a heng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Ka parih rinsannak an neih lo ruangah Izipt ram ihsin a suakmi sungin kum kul le a tlunlam mipa hmuahhmuah cu Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenih ka tiam ciami Kanaan ramah zohman an thleng hrimhrim lo ding,’ tiah siatcam in thu a kam zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih rinsannak a neitu Keniz mi Jefunneh ih fapa Kaleb le Nun ih fapa Joshua siar lo, midang hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih camsiatmi sungah an tel ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel misenpi parah Bawipa cu a thin a heng ih Bawipa a lungawi lotertu pawl an thih thluh hlanlo kum sawmli sung thlaler ramṭhing lakah vakvai in a tuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule atu-ah nannih santhar misualral pawl, Israel mi parah tuar ding ṭha lo Pathian ih thinhengnak thlengter sal dingin nan pupa pawl ih can-ai nan awh ve a sihi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nannih Reuben le Gad hrin pawl, atu-ah Bawipa ih dungthlun nan duh lo ngaingai a si ahcun hi Israel misenpi pawl hi Bawipa in hramlakah hin a dungtun lala hai ding ih siatsuah thluh an si ding ih nanmah hi mi siatsuahtu nan si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah annih in Moses cu an dil sal ih, “Kan tuu pawl hrangah lungto in hruang kan kulh pei ih kan fanau pawl hrangah kulhmi khawpi pawl kan din hmaisa pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kan unau Israel mi pawl thawn raldo tlang dingah kan timtuah pei ih an luah ding ram kan lak thluh hlanlo kanmah ih hmaihruai vekin kan ral pawl cu kan do pei. Cutiih kan do sungah kan fanau pawl hitawk kulhmi khawpi sungah an rak um pei ih hitawk ramih a rak ummi miphun pawl ih siatsuahnak an tuar lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel hrin pawl in an co dingmi ram an luah thluh hlanlo kan ram le kan khua ah kan kir lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hitawk Jordan Tiva ih nisuahnak lamah hin kan covo kan ngah zo ruangah Jordan khatlam ralah kannih in zianghman Israel hrin dangdang pawl lakah covo kan la lo ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Moses in an hnenah, “Nan simmi hi nan thinlung ngaingai a si ahcun atu ihsin Bawipa ih mithmuh ah raldo dingin nan tim tuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nan ralkap zatein pakhat hman hrelh loin Jordan Tiva nan tan pei ih Bawipa ih ho in ral cu nan do pei. Bawipa in kan ral a neh thluh hlanlo le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ram a lak ṭheh hlanlo nan do pei. Cuih hnu Bawipa ih hnenah le nan unau Israel mi pawl ih parah nan ṭuanvo nan ṭheh hnu lawngah nan kir thei ding. Cuticun Jordan Tiva in nisuahnak lam hitawk ram hi Bawipa in nan ta dingah a hngetter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan thutiammi nan thlun lo a si ahcun, atu ihsin thei cia uh, Bawipa ih parah misual nan si ding. Kan theih ual lo, tiah ti leh hlah uh. Nan sualnak in a lo hawl suak thotho ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah nan khawpi pawl cu din uhla nan tuu pawl hrangah hruang cu kulh uh. Cun nan kam awk vekin tuah suak rori uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Gad le Reuben hrin pawl cun, “Bawipa, na thupekmi vekin kan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kan nupi le kan faate pawl le kan caw le kan tuu pawl cu hitawk Gilead ram khawpi pawl ah hin an rak um ko pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A dang hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih ho in raldo dingah kan timtuah thluh a si. Na ti bangtuk in Jordan Tiva cu kan tan ding ih ral kan do ding,” tiah Moses cu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in Eleazar, Joshua, le Israel hruaitu dang pawl hnenah cun thu a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Gad le Reuben hrin pawl in Jordan Tiva an tan ih Bawipa ih ho in raldo dingah an feh ih, anmah ih bomnak in ram cu nan neh ṭheh a si ahcun an co dingah Gilead ram cu pek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla annih in Jordan Tiva an tan loih nanmah hnenah ral an do lo a si ahcun nanmah vek thotho in Kanaan ramah an covo cu an ngah ve ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah Gad le Reuben hrin pawl cun Moses hnenah, “ Bawipa Pathian ih thupekmi bangtuk in kan tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amah ih hmaiah hriamnam thawn Kanaan ram ahcun kan feh ding ih kan do ding; sikhalsehla Jordan Tiva ihsin nisuahnak lam hi ram hi cu kanmah ih covo thotho in a um ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in Amor siangpahrang Sihon le Bashan siangpahrang Og pawl ih ram hmuahhmuah cu, a kiangkapih khua le ram pawl thawn, Gad le Reuben hrin pawl le Manasseh hrin a hrek pawl hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gad hrin pawl in pharih kulhmi Dibon, Ataroth, Aroer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atroth Shofan, Jazer, Jogbehah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Beth Nimrah, le Beth Haran khawpi pawl cu an din sal. An tuu hrangah hruang tla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Reuben hrin pawl in Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nebo, Baal Meon (hi khua hmin cu an thleng), le Sibmah khawpi pawl cu an din sal. An din salmi khawpi pawl cu hmin thar an pek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cun Manasseh fapa Makhir hrin pawl in Gilead ram an do ih an luah hnuah cuih ramih a ummi Amor mi pawl cu an dawihlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in Gilead ram cu Makhir hrin pawl hnenah a pek ih cutawkah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Manasseh hrin Jair in khawte pawl a do ih a lak hnuah Jair Khawte pawl tiah hmin an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nobah khal in Kenath khua a do ih a kiangkap khawte pawl thawn a lak ih amah ih hmin suangin Nobah tiah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt ram in an suak ih Moses le Aaron ho in an riahnak hmunih hmin pawl cu a tanglam pawl hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupeknak bangtuk in Moses in an riahhmun pawl ih hmin cu a sangsang in a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Izipt ram in an suah kum, thla hmaisa bik ni hleinga ni a hmaisa bik Lantak Puai ih thaisun ah Izipt ram ihsin an suak. Bawipa ih humhimnak in Rameses khawpi in an pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih thahmi an fapa upa bik pawl an phum ih a buai rerotu Izipt misenpi ih hmuhhnganah Israel mi pawl cu an suak luilo. Hi bangtuk a si ruangah Bawipa cu Izipt ih khawzing pawl hnakin a cak sawn ticu Bawipa Amah in fiangtein a langter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Rameses in an suak ih Sukkoth ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sukkoth in an suak ih hramlak nelrawn kiangih ummi Etham ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Etham in an suak ih Baal Zefon in nisuahnak lamih ummi Pi Hahiroth lamah an kir ih Migdol kiangah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pi Hahiroth in an suak ih Tipi Sen an tan hnuah Etham nelrawn ramṭhing an thleng. Cuih nelrawn ramṭhing ah ni thum sung an feh ih Marah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Marah in an suak ih Elim ah riahhmun an tuah. Elim ah cerhti hmun hleihnih a um ih ṭhulhfau kung sawmsarih khal a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elim in an suak ih Tipi Sen tikel kiangah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutawk in an suak ih Sin nelrawn ramṭhing ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sin nelrawn ramṭhing in an suak ih Dofkah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dofkah in an suak ih Alush ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alush in an suak in Refidim ah riahhmun an tuah. Refidim ahcun misenpi hrangah tidai in ding a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Refidim in an suak ih Sinai nelrawn ramṭhing ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinai nelrawn ramṭhing in an suak ih Kibroth Hattaavah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kibroth Hattaavah in an suak ih Hazeroth ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hazeroth in an suak ih Rithmah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rithmah in an suak ih Rimmon Perez ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rimmon Perez in an suak ih Libnah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Libnah in an suak ih Rissah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rissah in an suak ih Kehelathah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kehelathah in an suak ih Shefer Tlang ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shefer Tlang in an suak ih Haradah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Haradah in an suak ih Makheloth ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Makheloth in an suak ih Tahath ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tahath in an suak ih Terah ah ruahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Terah in an suak ih Mithkah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mithkah in an suak ih Hashmonah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hashmonah in an suak ih Moseroth ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moseroth in an suak ih Bene Jaakan ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bene Jaakan in an suak ih Hor Haggidgad ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hor Haggidgad in an suak ih Jotbathah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jotbathah in an suak ih Abronah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Abronah in an suak ih Ezion Geber ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ezion Geber in an suak ih Zin nelrawn ramṭhingah riahhmun an tuah. (Zin cu Kadesh ti a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zin nelrawn ramṭhing in an suak ih Edom ram kiangte Hor Tlang ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupeknak bangtuk in puithiam Aaron cu Hor Tlang ah a kai ih Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl an suahnak kum sawmli kum, thla nganak ni hmaisa bik ni ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aaron cu a kum za le kul hluanthum a ti ah Hor Tlangah cun a thi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cun Thlanglam Kanaan ramih a ummi siangpahrang Arad in Israel mi pawl an ra ti kha a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hor tlang in an suak ih Zalmonah ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zalmonah in an suak ih Punon ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Punon in an suak ih Oboth ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Oboth in an suak ih Moab ram Iye Abarim ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Iye Abarim in an suak ih Dibon Gad ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Dibon Gad in an suak ih Almon Diblathaim ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Almon Diblathaim in an suak ih Nebo Tlang kiang Abarim Tlang ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Abarim Tlang in an suak ih Beth Jeshimoth le Akasia Phairawn karlak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jerikho zawn Jordan Tiva ral, Moab hmunrawn ah riahhmun an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jerikho khua zawn Jordan Tiva khatlam ral, Moab hmunrawn ahcun Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hrangah daan a pek: “Jordan Tiva nan tan ih Kanaan ram nan luh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />ram sungih a ummi miphun pawl cu nan dawi thluh hai ding. Lungto in siseh, thir in siseh, milem an tuahmi hmuahhmuah le an khuavang biaknak pawl hmuahhmuah cu nan siatsuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />An ram cu nan luah pei ih cunah nan um pei. Ziangahtile nan umnak dingah ka lo pe zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Kanaan ram cu nan hnam le nan hrin sungah camcawhfung zukin nan zem aw pei ih, hrin tam deuh pawl cu ram tum deuh, hrin mal deuh pawl cu ram fate deuh, tiin nan zem pei. Camcawhfung zukin an zemmi ram cu a zuktu in a co tata ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ram sungih a rak ummi pawl nan dawisuak hai lo a si ahcun nan lakih a taangmi pawl cu nan hrangah mit sungih hnawm bangtuk le nan hnak sungih misuntu hling bangtuk in hnaihnoktu le harnak a lo petu an si ding ih nan umnak kipah a lo do ringringtu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nan dawisuak lo a si ahcun anmah siatsuah thluh ding ka tum vekin nanmah khal ka lo siatsuah thluh hai ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hrangah a tanglam thu pawl cu a pek: “Kanaan ram nan luh tikah nan ramih ramri pawl cu a tanglam bangtuk in a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlanglam nan ramri cu Zin nelrawn in a thok pei ih Edom ramri in a feh ding. Tipi Thi thlanglam kap nisuahnak lam a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Akrabbim Tlangkawn lamah a vung suk pei ih Zin in a feh ding ih Kadesh Barnea tiang thlanglam ah a vung ding. Cule saklam nitlaknak lamah Hazar Addar ah a so ding ih Azmon tiang a feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin Izipt ramri tiva lamah a her-aw ding ih Mediterranean Tifinriat ah a net ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nitlaklam ramri cu Mediterranean Tifinriat a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Saklam ramri cu Mediterranean in Hor Tlang tiang a feh pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cutawk ihsin Hamath Tlangkawn tiang a feh pei. Cule Zedad le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zifron tiang a feh pei ih Hazar Enan ah a net ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Cun nisuahlam ramri cu Hazar Enan in Shefam tiang dingtein a feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih hnu ah Ain in nisuahnak lamih a ummi Harbel ah a vung suk ding ih cutawk in Galilee Tili nisuahnak lam kamih tlang ah a vung ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jordan Tiva thlun in thlanglam ah Tipi Thi tiang a suk ding. Himi pawl cu nan ram kimvelih ramri an si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Moses in Israel mi pawl hnenah, “Hi ram cu Bawipa in nanmah hrin hrin kua le a hrek pawl hnenih a lo pekmi ram a si ih camcawhfung zukin nan co dingmi ram a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Reuben le Gad hrin pawl le Manasseh hrin a hrek pawl cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jordan Tiva ih nisuahnak lam Jerikho khatlam ralah an innsang ciarin ram an zem-aw zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Puithiam Eleazar le Nun ih fapa Joshua in ram zem-awk cu ṭuanvo an lak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule anmah bawmtu dingah hrin khat in hotu pakhat fingfing hril awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a tanglam bangtuk in la aw: Judah hrin in Jefunneh ih fapa Kaleb,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simeon hrin in Ammihud ih fapa Shelumiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin hrin in Khislon ih fapa Elidad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan hrin in Jogli ih fapa Bukki,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef tefa Manasseh hrin in Efod ih fapa Hanniel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Efraim hrin in Shiftan ih fapa Kemuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zebulun hrin in Parnak ih fapa Elizafan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Issakhar hrin in Azzan ih fapa Paltiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asher hrin in Shelomi ih fapa Ahihud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Naftali hrin in Ammihud ih fapa Pedahel,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi hotu pawl cu Kanaan ram ah Israel mi pawl hrangih ram zemtu dingah Bawipa ih fialmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerikho khua zawn Jordan Tiva khatlam ral, Moab hmunrawn ah Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl sim awla an comi ram sung ihsin Levi mi pawl umnak ah khawpi pawl le khawpi kiangah ṭilva tlannak ram pawl an pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi khawpi pawl cu Levi mi pawl comi an si pei ih cutawkah an um pei. A kiangkap cu an caw le an ṭilva dangdang pawl hrangah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An khua kiang ṭilva tlannak ram cu khua phardawl ihsin tah in pi thawngkhat le zanga in a thok ding ih khua vuakvel ah a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun ṭilva tlannak ram cu an khua ihsin pi thawng thum a kau pei ih khua vuakvel ah a um ding ih a laifangah khawpi cu a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi mi pawl hnenah rolnak khawpi paruk nan pek pei ih mi pakhatkhat in lai a thah pang tikih a rolnak dingah a si pei. Hi hlei ah a dang khawpi sawmli le pahnih pek uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a zatein an tlangram pawl thawn khawpi sawmli le pariat an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An hrin ram ciar sungih Levi mi pawl ih khawpi zat ding cu an ram tum le fatet thu-in zoh a si pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mi pawl sim dingin thu a pek ih, “Jordan Tiva nan tan ih Kanaan ram nan luh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mi pakhat in milai a thah pang tikih a rolnak dingah khawpi pawl nan hril pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutawk ah a rol pei ih a thahmi sungkhat pawl in phuhlam an duh khalle a him ding. Mithah an puhmi pa cu misenpi hmaiih a thu an relcat hlan ahcun an that lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawpi paruk hril uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jordan Tiva in nisuahnak lamah khawpi pathum, Kanaan ramah khawpi pathum nan hril pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi khawpi pawl cu Israel mi siseh, hrin dangmi a laangte ih a ummi, a si lole reipi a ummi siseh, milai an thah pang tikah an rolnak khawpi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sikhalsehla mi pakhat in thir hriamhrei hmang tahrat in mi a thah a si ahcun laithat a si ruangah amah cu thah a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in lungto hmang tahrat in mi a thah a si ahcun laithat a si ruangah amah cu thah a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in thingtan lak tahrat in mi a thah a si ahcun laithat a si ruangah amah cu thah a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thahmi pa ih sungkhat nai bik in laithat pa cu a that ve ding. A hmuh tik pohah a that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in midang pakhat cu a hua ih khaam ah a tuul thlak, a si lole a bawh ih ziangin maw a deng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a si lole a kuttum in a thong ih a thih a si ahcun laithat a si ruangah amah cu thah a si pei. A thah mi-ih sungkhat nai bik in laithat pa cu a that ve ding. A hmuh tik pohah a that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in a huatmi a si lo naón midang pakhat a tuul thlak pang, a si lole bawh loin ziangin simaw a deng pangih a thi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a si lole ṭhatein zohta loin mi pakhat in lungto a deng ih tumhrim si lo, a ral khal a si lo naón midang pakhat a deng that pang a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />misenpi pawl in a thu an ṭhen sak tikah a thi mi-ih sungkhat, phulak tumtu ṭan loin mi a that pangtu ṭan in a thu cu an rel pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misenpi pawl in laithat an puhmi pa cu phulak a duhtu, a thi mi pa-ih sungkhat pawl hnen ihsin nan humsuak pei ih a rak rolnak khua ahcun nan kuat sal pei. Mi a thah laiih Puithiam Sang a ṭuantu a thih hlanlo cu cutawk khua ah a um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laithat pa cu a rolnak khua in a suak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a thah mi ih sungkhat in an hmu ih an thah a si ahcun himi cu phuhlam a si ruangah laithat a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Laithat pa cu rolnak khawpi ah Puithiam Sang a nun sung hmuahhmuah cu a um pei. Puithiam Sang a thih hnuah cun a inn ah a kir thei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi daan pawl cu nanmah le nan tesinfa pawl in khuitawkih nan um khal asile nan thlun dingmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Laithah an puhmi pa cu thutheitu pahnih maw, pahnih hnakih tam maw an um lawngah laithat tiin thah theih a si pei. Thutheitu pakhat ih theihnak lawng cu laithat ti dingah a kim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Laithat cu thah a si pei. Thahnak in luat dingah paisa in a tlen-aw thei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rolnak khawpiih a rol zomi pa cu Puithiam Sang a thih hlan ahcun a khua ah kir sal dingah tlennak paisa a pek khalle nan sang lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nan kirter asile nan umnak nan ram cu nan ti borhhlawh a si. Laithahnak in ram cu nan borhhlawhter ih mi pakhatkhat an thahnak ram thianter dingah laithat pa an thah ve dah ti lo ahcun sualthlah thiannak dang zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nan umnak ram cu borhhlawhter hlah uh, ziangahtile keimah hi Bawipa ka si ih Israel mi lakah ka um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef ih fapa Manasseh ih fapa Makhir ih fapa Gilead hrin pawl innsang fingfingih hotu ciar cu Moses le a dang hruaitu pawl hnenah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hnenah, “ Bawipa in hi ram cu Israel mi hnen ah camcawhfung zukin zem dingah thu a lo pek a si. Cuih tlunah kan unau Zelofehad ih ram cu a fanu pawl hnenih pek dingah thu a lo pek fawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a fanu pawl in Israel miphun sungih hrin dangmi an pasal ahcun an ram cu cute hrinih ta ah a cang dingih kannih kan zate ih kan ngahmi ram cu a fiak vivo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thilri le leiram zuar ciami hmuahhmuah a rak nei hmaisatu hnenih khirh sal kum a ra thlen hmanah Zelofehad fanu pawl ih ram cu a kumkhua in an pasal pawl hrinih leiram a si tata ding ih kannih hrin hrangah cun kan sung ngaingai ding a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in Israel mi hnenah Bawipa ih fial bangtuk in thu a pek: “Josef hrin hotu pawl ih an simmi thu hi thudik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa ih thupekmi cu hi bangtuk in a si: Zelofehad fanu pawl cun an duhmi zokhal an pasal thei ding. Asinain anmah ih hrin sungmi lawng an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi kip in an ram neihmi cu anmah ih hrin lengah an fehter lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel miphun sungah nunau in ram a neih a si ahcun amah ih hrin sung lawngah pasal a nei pei. Cuticun Israel mi kipin an pupa ih ram cu an co thei pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />leiram cu hrin khat in hrin khatah a feh lo pei. An hrin tinin an leiram ciar cu an co ringring pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Zelofehad ih fanu pawl cun Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zelofehad fanu Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milkah, le Noah pawl cun an pa-ih unau sungkhat ih fapa pawl an pasal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josef fapa Manasseh hrin sungmi mipa pawl an pasal ih an ram cu an pa ih hrin sungah a um ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi daan pawl le thupekmi pawl cu Jerikho khua zawn, Jordan Tiva ral Moab hmunrawn ah Bawipa in Israel mi hrangah Moses hnenih a pekmi an si.
  </para>
</usx>
